<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JDG" style="id">EN_ULT en_English_ltr Fri Oct 04 2019 15:43:59 GMT-0400 (EDT) tc</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Tutiakme</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tutiakme Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Tutiakme</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tut.</para>
  <para style="mt">Judges</para>
  <para style="mt">Tutiakme Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Laisiukwak aide Joshua tsit dwa nah Samuel heta ketei kakga Israelme rasam rangbam. Aipau tingkak de kengkiengme, tutiakme lie qukelamedung, Israel leuhme reu kedi teikelame tingdau lie la. Tutiakme laisiukwak ga pe rehi ge nzui kecu teibam:</para>
  <para style="ip">1. Israelme au Tinggwang gwatei nah pecu hung keladau lungciep bam eh lungh.</para>
  <para style="ip">2. Israelme Tinggwang de nsung tadi nah mamie reca di.</para>
  <para style="ip">3. Tinggwang kidame leuh de langgai eh regi nah peu penui reu di.</para>
  <para style="ip">4. Israelme Tinggwang da nreugwang eh penui maugi beulo kiedi.</para>
  <para style="ip">5. Tinggwang pe minadung mau gibeu nah penui ngauraume de gwalu kera tutiakme langgai eh penuide ngha nah kelilu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Aipauting Israelme ha ga pe rehi teidai dai kecu tei. Tutiakme pelane ge kereiemengei muiteu tei kegwang ha raupwa la. Penui ha ci mcitubedung au Deborah, Gideon, nah Samson.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Tutiakmedung dau ha (1:1-3:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Heleuhdung kegwa nah tutiakme puisau ketei (3:7-16:31)</para>
  <para style="io1">Mamie kereca nah renamme reutak (17:1-21:25)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JDG 1" />
  <para style="s">Israelme Canaanme kedadung de regikecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 1:1" />Joshua tsai kedicai, Israelmedung RAMPAUBE dage ranggai, “Caube ne Canaanme de regi kera anuide teuswa rai zieno?” <verse eid="JDG 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 1:2" />RAMPAUBE keligai, “Judah leuhme nghang zie. Ainie, Ih pe ba gage Canaanme deu peubeu dida.” <verse eid="JDG 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 1:3" />Pecai Judahme penui siname Israelme, Simeon leuhme dade rangdi, “Anuide RAMPAUBE ne kepeube deu dega anuide ngngwa nghang lo, iciu eh anui Canaanme de ngngwa regi go. Anui de cinzwa regi zie, RAMPAUBE ne nnuide kepeube deu dega.” Cine Simeon leuhme penuide ngngwa miedi. <verse eid="JDG 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 1:4" />Judah leuhme nghangdi, nah RAMPAUBE Canaanme nah Perizzme de pwa penai ba gage kai gaibeu, nah penai Bezek de qukela bam gade mina cang kerei de gidi. <verse eid="JDG 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 1:5" />Penai Bezek ga Adoni-Bezek de ngaulu nah penai pecu ngngwa regi. Penai Canaanme nah Perizzme de ngamlu. <verse eid="JDG 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 1:6" />Ge hegwangpei Adoni-Bezek pakdi, dede penai pecai zuimie. Penai pecu tuilu, nah penai pe ba zurangpui nah pe pi zurangpui kenana dangdi. <verse eid="JDG 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 1:7" />Adoni-Bezek rangdi, “Hegwang riakhena penui ba zurangpui nah penui pi zurangpui dang kedime a taktyeibam kang ga ketyei kwariedung tangra kemiebe kebau bamla. Ih tei kedi nzwa Tinggwang acu peu daida.” Pecai Judahme pecu Jerusalem ga ngngwa gwanglu, nah cikade pa tsaidi.<verse eid="JDG 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 1:8" />Judahme Jerusalem namdi dede ngngwa regi eh penui cide de ngamlu. Penui cika minadung de teitsetdi eh namdi de rudi. <verse eid="JDG 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 1:9" />Pecai, Judahme, Canaanme kideutu deudi ga lungh kebammedung, nah tingbangle hetaideu lebie, nah naimiak kenlütle hangdeu kehenah ga lungh kebamme de ngngwa regi kera miedi. <verse eid="JDG 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 1:10" />Pecai Judahme Canaanme Hebron ga lungh kebam ga nghung (ndaa Hebron de Kiriath Arba lie qula), nah penui Sheshai, nah Ahiman, nah Talmai leuhmedung de ngamlu.<verse eid="JDG 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 1:11" />Judahme cikade Debir ga lungh kelame da miedi (ndaa Debir de Kiriath Sepher lie qula). <verse eid="JDG 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 1:12" />Pecai Caleb rangdi, “Keheibede Kiriath Sepher de gwa nah cide tui kelube de pe nau kerane, Ih a napui Aksah de pecu peu zie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Joshua 14:6-15</char></note> <verse eid="JDG 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 1:13" />Kenaz napei, Othniel, Caleb caihereibe, cide tuilu, cine pa pecu pe napui Aksah de penau kera peudi. <verse eid="JDG 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 1:14" />Aksah gwang kelucai pa Othniel lung teigai eh pecu peu pe pei dade luhpak ge kie lulo rangdi. Pa gada reu gade nghung, ge Caleb pe dage rangdi, “Ih n ziemne dai teilu buino?” <verse eid="JDG 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 1:15" />Pecai Aksah pe pei dage kiedi, “Acu samlam ge peulo. Nang acu Negev deu de peu liede, nang acu duilet dung dede peulo.” Cine Caleb pecu duilet nreubedung nah duilet ngkangbedung peudi.<verse eid="JDG 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 1:16" />Moses nau pei leuhme, Kenit namedung, Jewmedung de ngngwalwe lira namdi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jericho</char></note> de gidi eh, Arad deudi tingbangle kebam Judah hetaideu ga miedi. Cine pa mie Amelikme de ngngwa lungh ladi. <verse eid="JDG 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 1:17" />Pecai Judah leuhme penui siname Israel Simeon leuhme de nzang miedi nah penai Zephath ga lungh kebam Canaanme de ngamlu. Cine penai helungkai eh cide ngkapdi nah penai namdi cide de Hormah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide pekie ngkap cangsiak kedi</char></note> de qudi. <verse eid="JDG 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 1:18" />Judahme Gaza, Ashkelon, nah Ekron nah twagwapung kebam deudung de tuilu. <verse eid="JDG 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 1:19" />RAMPAUBE au Judah de ngngwala nah pa kideutu deudi de gumlu, dede pa langkam ga kelungmedung hegeu bagidung kebamde ziemne gwa luma. <verse eid="JDG 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 1:20" />Penui Moses ne rang kebeu nzwa Caleb de Hebron peudi, nah pa cikade Anak pautsa hangcum de gwampet di. <verse eid="JDG 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 1:21" />Dede Jerusalem ga lungh kebam Jebusitme, Benjamin leuhmedung de gwagi luma. Cine Jebusme henai kecang de<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tutiakme laisiukwak rau kelu tingdau kecang</char></note> Benjamin leuhmedung de Jerusalem ga ngngwa lungh ladi.<verse eid="JDG 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 1:22" />Cinzwa Joseph leuhme mie Bethel de renia, RAMPAUBE penuide ngngwa la. <verse eid="JDG 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 1:23" />Joseph leuhme Bethel rehi pie kerana reketme de langmpetgai; ndaa namdi cide Luz lie qula. <verse eid="JDG 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 1:24" />Mie kepieme namdi cikade mige tetmpet kecu ngau, nah penui pe dage rangdi, “Anuide kehereide namdibe ga kelüt kimuiki de saulia lo, iciude anui ncu ngaunggia beuzie.” <verse eid="JDG 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 1:25" />Cine pa penuide namdi kelüt kirie de saulia gai, nah penui namdi de kiengtie teu ngam di, dede penui minabe de nah pe kelak pelane de püt beu. <verse eid="JDG 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 1:26" />Pecai minadung Hittime deu ga miedi nah pa namdi ge teilu. Pa cide Luz qulu, cide henai kecangde cinzwa qula.<verse eid="JDG 1:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 1:27" />Dede Manasseh leuhmDede Manasseh leuhme Beth Shan leuhme de gum ma, mede Taanach, mede Dor ga lungh kebamme, mede Ibleam ga lungh kebamme, mede Megiddo ga nah pe taiga lungh kebamme, kedanemene Canaanme kideu cika lungh kera cetla kedine. <verse eid="JDG 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 1:28" />Israel ngkieng reureu luge, pa Canaanme dade ceha lu cuhdi, dede pa penuide gwampet dima.<verse eid="JDG 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 1:29" />Mede Ephraim leuhme liede Gezer ga lungh kebam Canaanme de gwagi dima, cine Canaanme pe leuhme kakga Gezer ga lunghdi.<verse eid="JDG 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 1:30" />Zebulunme liede Kitron ga lungh kebamme de gwagi dima, mede Nahalol ga kelunghme de de, cine Canaanme penui kakga lunghdi. Dede penui kemei tei eh peu penui gwatei.<verse eid="JDG 1:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 1:31" />Asher leuhme au Akko namdi ga lungh kebamme de, mede Sidon namdi ga, mede Ahlab, mede Achzib, mede Helbah, mede Aphek, mede Rehob namdidung ga lungh kebamme de gwagi dima. <verse eid="JDG 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 1:32" />Cine Asher leuhme kideu cika Canaanme kakga lungh ladi, kedanemene Asher leuhme penuide gwagi di kemakne.<verse eid="JDG 1:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 1:33" />Naphtali de Beth Shemesh ga lungh kelame de gwagi dima, mede Beth Anath ga lungh kelame de. Cine pa kideu cika Canaanme kakga lungh di. Iciude, Beth Shemesh nah Beth Anath ga lungh kelame au penui kemei tei eh peu penui gwatei.<verse eid="JDG 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 1:34" />Amorme ne Dan leuhme de nia pwa kideutu deudi gage kaidi, kedanemene pa pecu peu langkam ga nghung kera kaam kedine. <verse eid="JDG 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 1:35" />Amorme Aijalon ga, Heres Deutu ga lunghdi kera cetlu, nah Shaalbim ga, dede Joseph leuhme ngkieng pet luge, Amorme depeu penui kangga lungh eh penui gwatei di. <verse eid="JDG 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 1:36" />Amorme deurai au Akrabbim gicak gade, nghang hetialwa nreule kecang.<verse eid="JDG 1:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JDG 2" />
  <para style="s">Bokim ga Rampaube gwame</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 2:1" />RAMPAUBE gwabe Gilgal cuikui gade Bokim cuikui ga nghang eh rangdi, “Ih Egypt gade n lampui sau nghang beuda, nah Ih nnui paume dage rang kebeube deu de ga nnuide ngngwa gwang luda. Ih ranggai da, ‘Ih kelungta nnuide ngngwa samkak kelude gade nreu dilak. <verse eid="JDG 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 2:2" />Hangdeu aika lungh kebam kedame de nnui ngngwa samkak gede teilak. Penui recabamdung nnui teipang bi di maisia.’ Dede nnui a kwa kingnei ma. Nnui ai dai teidi deno? <verse eid="JDG 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 2:3" />Aide Ih rangsi gai, ‘Ih nnui dwa gade penuide gwampet dilak, dede penui au nnui ngauraumme dizie, nah penui rabedung au hetak tei kenzeu ge nzwa nnuide renia zie’.” <verse eid="JDG 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 2:4" />RAMPAUBE gwabe sam aidungde Israel name pelane dage rang kedi dau, minadung penui kwa sahbak eh hapdi. <verse eid="JDG 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 2:5" />Cine penui heni cide de Bokim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bokim pekie hapbam kecu.</char></note> qudi, nah penui cikade RAMPAUBE de ratak ge teibeu.<verse eid="JDG 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samzai tei kemak nah ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 2:6" />Pecai Joshua minadung de peu tetdi, nah Israel namedung kideu gumlu kerane pe magum riep ga miedi. <verse eid="JDG 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 2:7" />Minadung RAMPAUBE gwa teilu Joshua keringting pelane nah hangkiame Joshua cai lungtie kebamme keringting pelane, RAMPAUBE Israel ziemne tei kegai bata kedi pelane ngau kelume. <verse eid="JDG 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 2:8" />Joshua, Nun napei, RAMPAUBE kilabe, mmi hai ge kerei dau tsaidi. <verse eid="JDG 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 2:9" />Pecai penui pecu Timnath Heres ga pe mabam deurai lunggage kungdi, kideutu deudi Ephraim gage, Gaash Deutu tingpeule ge. <verse eid="JDG 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 2:10" />Joshua ceheu pelane penui paumedung da gwang ngkwa keludau, ceheu keda ge penui cai lunghcuh dailu, penui RAMPAUBE de cima nah pa Israel ziemne tei kegai tadung de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:36">Bat. 13:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 2:11" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dwade kemau teidi nah penui Baal miedung gwa teidi. <verse eid="JDG 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 2:12" />Iciu eh penui RAMPAUBE de pütdi, penui paume Tinggwang de, penuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpet kebeube. Penui hera kedadung cai suidi penuide twagwa kebam rabedung, nah penui da keu mie penui. Penui RAMPAUBE rata teidi. <verse eid="JDG 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 2:13" />Penui RAMPAUBE de pütdi nah penui Baal mie nah Ashtoreth rabepui mie de reca teidi. <verse eid="JDG 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 2:14" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Israelme de pe rata sütdi, cine pa penuide ngauraume ba gage kaidi, nah ngauraume ne penuide ngkapdi. Pa peu penui de twagwa pung kebam penui ngauraume leune ba gage kaidi, peu penui ngauraume dwaga sap silu tadi kerane. <verse eid="JDG 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 2:15" />Kehei gade, penui keheidau tet kepet dau RAMPAUBE kengkieng penuide renia eh teingkap kerane, RAMPAUBE rang kebeu nzwa nah RAMPAUBE penui dage sampet kebeu nzwa. Iciu eh pa penuide ketang sünne gai.<verse eid="JDG 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 2:16" />Pecai RAMPAUBE tutiakmedung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Laisiukwak kehegwabe tingdau tutiakme au henai hemaabe reu muiteube tei kelame ge nzwa da. Hetutiak kecu ta rünne mene Israelme teilung reu puisau tei beula.</char></note> de teucuh lu, nah penuine Israelme de kengkapme ba gade kelilu. <verse eid="JDG 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 2:17" />Penui au tutiakmedung samde kingnei tadi. Penui au kemmha ta tei eh hera kedadung caisui di nah penui au penui da keumie di. Penui au penui peime lampui tet kegwangde gade nreu zette di. Penui cinzwa eh RAMPAUBE ajadung tei mzai nah kingnei tadi. <verse eid="JDG 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 2:18" />RAMPAUBE penui ziemne tutiakme teucuh keludau, RAMPAUBE au tutiakme de ngngwa la nah pa penuide tutiakmedung ting pelane ga penui ngauraumedung ba gade kelibeu. Kedanemene RAMPAUBE au penui ngauraume penuide sa nah tei keherei eh mrah kecu ngau eh pe lung sia di kelane. <verse eid="JDG 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 2:19" />Tutiakbe tsaidi ge, penui au caili eh penui paumedung swade penui zai siaki dila, hera kedadung caisui eh penui gwatei nah penui da keumie dila. Penui bata kesia ketde püt lama mede penui hengamkegah zai reli leunede. <verse eid="JDG 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 2:20" />Cine RAMPAUBE rata Israel reu gwangdi, nah pa rangdi, “Heleuh aide Ih penui paume de rangkebeu a samkak gileu kedine, dede penui a sam kingnei kemakne, <verse eid="JDG 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 2:21" />Ih de penui kebam gade Joshua tsai kedi dau pa kaikenzeu heleuhdung de ketde gwa mpet silak da. <verse eid="JDG 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 2:22" />Penuide teu eh Israel de kedeipie kera, penui RAMPAUBE lampui nzui lami me bi, penui paume mnei kela nzwa mi mebi kecu.” <verse eid="JDG 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 2:23" />Cine RAMPAUBE heleuh cidungde de peu lungh bamdi, penuide gwagi nzet di mene, nah pa penuide Joshua ba gage kaibeu dima.<verse eid="JDG 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JDG 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 3:1" />Heleuh cidungde de teu eh Israel de kedei kerane RAMPAUBE ne kaipwa kebamme, penui pelane Canaan reutakdung ketde cibam ma, <verse eid="JDG 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 3:2" />Israel name ceheu ziemne hereu keteiciem ledeu kera, cidungde ndaade ci kemakmedung, <verse eid="JDG 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 3:3" />Philistinme deuceudime hangmengei, nah Canaanme pelane, Sidonme, nah Lebanon deutu ga lunghkebam Hivitme, Baal Hermon Deutu gade Lebo Hamath kecang kemdei ga. <verse eid="JDG 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 3:4" />Penuide teu eh Israel de kedei kera, penui RAMPAUBE ajadung kingnei zie mi lak bi cilu kerane, Pa cide Moses ba gade penui peimedung dage rang kebeude. <verse eid="JDG 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 3:5" />Cine Israel namedung Canaanme, Hittime, nah Amoritme, nah Perizzitme, nah Hivitme, nah Jebusitme kakga lunghdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 106:35">Lei. 106:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 3:6" />Israelme napeidung kesa penui napuidungde de keu penau teilu, nah Israelme napuidungde de penui napeime nau di kera pwa peu, cinzwa eh penui sangme rabedung de reca di.<verse eid="JDG 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Othniel Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 3:7" />Cine Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dwa gade kemau aide tei di nah penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de nsungtadi. Penui Baal nah Asherah miedung de reca teidi. <verse eid="JDG 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 3:8" />Ciziemne, RAMPAUBE Israelme de pe rata sütdi, ciciu eh pa penuide Aram Naharaim me gwangpei Cushan-Rishathaim ba gage zwa gaidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pa Cushan-Rishathaim de peu penui de ngamlu</char></note> Israel namedung mmi heset Cushan-Rishathaim gwatei. <verse eid="JDG 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 3:9" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage hap kegai dau, RAMPAUBE Israel namedung ziemne kelikelube ge teucuh beu, nah pa penuide kelibeu: Othniel, Kenaz napei, Caleb caihereibe. <verse eid="JDG 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 3:10" />RAMPAUBE rabe pe reuga gwanglu, nah pa Israel tutiak. Pa hereu ga tetpet nah RAMPAUBE Cushan-Rishathaim, Aram gwangpei de, pe ba gage kaibeu. Iciu eh Cushan-Rishathaim reu pe bane ngkieng lu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 27:18">Pum. 27:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 3:11" />Cine Israel deudi ga mmi riakdai lungciep bamlu. Pecai Kenaz napei Othniel tsaidi.<verse eid="JDG 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ehud Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 3:12" />Pecai Israel namedung kemau aidungde RAMPAUBE dwade teidai cuhdi. Cine RAMPAUBE Eglon de kengkieng peu, Moab gwangpei Israel de renia kera, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE dwade kemau aide tei kedine. <verse eid="JDG 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 3:13" />Pecai Eglon au Ammon penai Amalek namedung de kelanglu delwe mie Israel de renia, nah penui palm bang namdi Jericho de gumlu. <verse eid="JDG 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 3:14" />Cine Israel namedung mmi kereieheset Moab gwangpei Eglon gwatei.<verse eid="JDG 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 3:15" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage hapgai ge, RAMPAUBE penui ziemne kelikelube ge teucu beu, Ehud, Gera napei, Benjamin leuh ge, pa pe ba hile heziu mege. Israel namedung Moab gwangpei, Eglon dage ceha peba gage langgai beula.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 78:34">Lei. 78:34</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 3:16" />Pecai Ehud pe ziemne kingtie pemui lule ailam kebam ge teilu, pe tie keige. Pa cide pe mnie zetle reuga pe paikang gage kezui lu. <verse eid="JDG 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 3:17" />Pecai pa ceha de Eglon, Moab gwangpei taiga teugwang lu. Eglon au mina pelui yisüt kecu kauge. <verse eid="JDG 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 3:18" />Ehud ceha de teugwang kelu ta tei cangdi ge, pa ceha pwa kegwang minadung de langgi di. <verse eid="JDG 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 3:19" />Dede pa be Gilgal taiga tsupang bam gade caili di, nah hegwangpei ranggai, “Ih nziemne kengkiem samge lalei, O hegwangpei.” Cine hegwangpei pe mina da rangdi, “Matuso!” Cine pecu sap twagwa kebam leune pe dade tetdi. <verse eid="JDG 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 3:20" />Cine Ehud peda gwanglu. Pa pe katei bam kela kipeu ga kibung kengkung ga bam. Ehud rangdi, “Ih nziemne Tinggwang dade samge lalei,” nah pa pebam gade cuhlu. <verse eid="JDG 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 3:21" />Pecai Ehud pe ba hile ketwa pet pe mnie zetle reu gade kingtie de keulu, nah pa cide pe za gage reugai. <verse eid="JDG 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 3:22" />Kingtie tang si eh nlütdi, pa kingtie de pe za gade züt di kemak ziemne hekietang de peca ne gumpwadi. Pecai pa kigu gage tet gaidi, <verse eid="JDG 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 3:23" />Nah Ehud kigu gwale mpetlu nah pa kibung kipeu pecai kikamdung ngkuidi nah ncapdi.<verse eid="JDG 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 3:24" />Pa hegwale mpet luge, hegwangpei kilamedung gwanglu. Penui pie gaige, kipeu bungde kikamdung cap kenzeu ngaulu. Cine pe kilame rangdi, “Pa au kengkung ki bung ga pe pideu kezui pwa bam kesang auzie.” <verse eid="JDG 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 3:25" />Penui petauta kedi kecang kwa bam, dede pa au kipeubung kikamdung ngkei tadi. Cine penui chabi keulu delwe cidung de ngkeilu, nah penui gwangpei tsai eh kipi ga kauzeu kecu ngaulu.<verse eid="JDG 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 3:26" />Cidau penui kwa eh kebam dau Ehud pakdi nah tsupang bam tetkah lu, pecai pa Seirah namdi gage pak gaidi. <verse eid="JDG 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 3:27" />Pa kegwang dau, pa kideutu deudi Ephraim gade teluibe kwagai. Ge Israel namedung kideutu deudi gade pecu ngngwa eh nghung, nah pa au penui dwaga la. <verse eid="JDG 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 3:28" />Pecai pa penui dage rangdi, “A cai suilu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui ba gage nnui ngauraume, Moab de kaibeu di kecune.” Cine penui pecu sui nghung delwe penui Moab mcwa kebam Jordan kapet kera ni de tuilu. Iciu eh penui peu migede de tetkah kedi tei ma. <verse eid="JDG 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 3:29" />Cine cidau penui Moab de ngkapdi, mina cangkerei kenzwa ge. Pelane ntiprip nah pelane ngkieng, dede migede pak luma. <verse eid="JDG 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 3:30" />Cipaunai Israelme ba gade Moab kaudi, nah mmi riakheset ge Israel deudi ga lungciep bamlu.<verse eid="JDG 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shamgar Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 3:31" />Pecai Shamgar, Anath napei, nah pane Philistinme de teitsetdi, tumkwa tuitie gele mina haiherok de. Iciu eh pa de Israel de kelilu.<verse eid="JDG 3:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JDG 4" />
  <para style="s">Deborah Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 4:1" />Ehud tsai kedicai, Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dwade mau lie kecube tei daidi. <verse eid="JDG 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 4:2" />Cine RAMPAUBE penui de Canaan gwangpei, Jabin ba gage kaidi, Hazor ga hegwang teigwang kecude. Pegu reugwamaa muibe au Sisera, nah pa Harosheth Haggoyim ga lungh bamla. <verse eid="JDG 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 4:3" />Pecai Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage hapgai, kedanemene pa hegeu le tei kelu bagidung haihekui bam nah pa Israel namedung de zaisiet ngkingsüt kecu teu eh mmi ngkai ge teikeherei la kecune.<verse eid="JDG 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 4:4" />Deborah au caihakeci puige, Lappidoth nau. Cidau pa Israel tutiakla. <verse eid="JDG 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 4:5" />Pa kideutu deudi Ephraim ga Ramah penai Bethel kakga, Deborah palm bang kangga ntum la nah Israel name tutiak ziemne peda gwang. <verse eid="JDG 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 4:6" />Pa Barak de qu kera mide langgai, Abinoam napei, Kedesh Naphtali renam gade. Pa pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ajahkai meni: ‘Tabor Deutu ga mie cu, nah nang Naphtali namedung nah Zebulun namedung kakgade mina cangkerei de ngngwa luzie’? <verse eid="JDG 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 4:7" />‘Ih Sisera de keu mpet luzie, Jabin reugwamaa muibe de, Kishon Reuki kunga de, nah pe kün gari nah pe madibe de, nah Ih pecu pwa n ba gage kai beu zie’.” <verse eid="JDG 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 4:8" />Barak pe sam keligai, “Nang acu nzangmie cai, Ih miezie, dede nang acu nzangmie mecai, Ih mie lak.” <verse eid="JDG 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 4:9" />Pa mdugai, “Ih ncu nzangmie kesang zie, nang kemie lampui de au ncu kerüt gade lak, dede mipuige ba teu eh RAMPAUBE au Sisera de kaibeu zie kecune.” Pecai Deborah cuhlu delwe Barak de nzang Kedesh ga mie di. <verse eid="JDG 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 4:10" />Pecai Barak Zebulun nah Naphtali de Kedesh renam gage qugai. Nah mina cang kerei pecai suilu eh hangdi, nah Deborah pecu ngngwa hangdi.<verse eid="JDG 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 4:11" />Kenitme pei Heber, Cain dade mpet tsam lu, Hobab namedung dade, Moses nau pei. Pa Kedesh taiga kebam Zaanannim ga mhu bang kemdei ga mie pe paiki lim lu.<verse eid="JDG 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 4:12" />Penui Sisera dage Barak, Abinoam napei, Tabor Deutu ga hangdi delie pau kebeu dau, <verse eid="JDG 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 4:13" />Sisera pegu bagidung pelane de qulu, hegeukwen bagi hai hekui, nah mina pecu ngngwa kela pelane, Harosheth Haggoyim namdi gade Kishon reuki kecang gade. <verse eid="JDG 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 4:14" />Pecai Deborah Barak de rangbeu, “Cuhlu! Henai RAMPAUBE au Sisera de kaipwa n ba ga ge kepeu dau, RAMPAUBE n dwa ga tet mie meni?” Cine Barak mina cangkerei pecu si eh Tabor Deutu gade nghung di. <verse eid="JDG 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 4:15" />RAMPAUBE kebwak gai Sisera nah hekwen garidung pelane nah reugwame pelane de kingtie lwe Barak dwade. Cine Sisera hekwen gari gade nghunglwe pepi le pak tetdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 83:9">Lei. 83:9</ref>,<ref loc="PSA 83:10">10</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 4:16" />Dede Barak hekwen garidung nah reugwame de Harosheth Haggoyim kecang zuimie, nah Sisera reugwame pelane kingtie dwade kaudi, migede bang luma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:12">Rom. 2:12</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 4:17" />Ciuliede Sisera Jael paiki ga pe pile pak gwangdi, pa Keniteme pei Heber nau, kedanemene Hazor gwangpei Jabin nah Kenitme pei Heber kelak ga lungciep bam kecune. <verse eid="JDG 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 4:18" />Jael Sisera de redau kera tetpet nah pedade rangdi, “Aika gwanglu, a kedibo, ada gwanglu lo. Ngngi so.” Cine pa peda nreugwang pe paiki ga lüt lu, nah pa paige teu pecu gum kebai di. <verse eid="JDG 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 4:19" />Pa pedade kiedi, “Kehereide sak kera dui nage acu peugai lo, Ih hereudi delu.” Cine pa tungdui teigeu lade ngkeilwe sak kera pecu peu, delwe pecu gumdi. <verse eid="JDG 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 4:20" />Pecai pa pedage rangdi, “Paiki kimui ga saplu. Keheibe de gwang eh ncu keteu eh ‘Aika mige de bam mi?’ De rangcai, ‘Nang melie rangzie.’” <verse eid="JDG 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 4:21" />Pecai Heber nau, Jael paiki gwak de keulu nah pa hegeuteisang pe baga pwalu. Pa matu mene peda gwanglu, delwe pa pegwak de pe takla gade giamie hangdeu gage kaidi. Kedanemene pa au zipzing kedine nah leukedine, iciu eh pa tsaidi. <verse eid="JDG 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 4:22" />Pecai, Barak Sisera de zuila nah Jael pecu redau kera tetpet eh pe dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, acu peu nang peikelabe de pwa ncu liagai lo.” Cine pa peda gwanglu, ge Sisera tsai kau kezeu ngaulu, nah magwak de petakla ga bam.<verse eid="JDG 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 4:23" />Cine cipaunai Israel namedung dwade, Tinggwang ne Canaan gwangpei, Jabin de ngkapdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 18:47">Lei. 18:47</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 4:24" />Iciu eh Israel namedung Canaan gwangpei, Jabin de renia mtei sütdi, Canaan gwangpei Jabin de ngkapkedi ga kecangde nghangcang di.<verse eid="JDG 4:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JDG 5" />
  <para style="s">Deborah lei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 5:1" />Cine Deborah cipaunai Barak, Abinoam napei, de ngngwa lei tei, marang eh:<verse eid="JDG 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 5:2" />“Israel ga muiteume penui dwa tetpet kecudau, minadung neunga eh hezi raulu, mileune RAMPAUBE de samlam beu!<verse eid="JDG 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 5:3" />Kingneilu, Oh hegwangmedung! Kingnei lo, Oh kedimedung! Ih, RAMPAUBE dage, Ih de, Ih lei teizie, Ih RAMPAUBE dage lei teigai zie, Israel Tinggwang dage.<verse eid="JDG 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 5:4" />RAMPAUBO, nang Seir gade tetmpet kedine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">nang Edom deu gade tetmpet kegaine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">kideube de teu kelaidi, tinggimdung de zau mie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:4">hemwa keremangdung gade de dui zaumie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:26">Heb. 12:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 5:5" />RAMPAUBE kebam lamlwadung lwa petdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:5">Sinai aide, RAMPAUBE kebamne, Israel Tinggwang.<verse eid="JDG 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 5:6" />Shamgar tingdau, Anath napei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">Jael tingdau, lampui kemlangdung putdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:6">nah puiceunadung ga ketetme puikoidung pwagwang.<verse eid="JDG 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 5:7" />Israel ga namceu ga kelunghme bamtadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:7">Ih cuh kemaktane penui bamtadi, Ih Deborah, teuswa cuhlu ge, mipui ge pe name ma kepie nzwa Ih Israelme ma pielu!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2SA 20:19">2 Sam. 20:19</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 5:8" />Israelmedung hera kehecidung reca kecudau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">cidau namdibe riekidung ga hereu ketei bam dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">hegeu mede hengei ngau tadi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:8">Israel mina cang riakdai kakga.<verse eid="JDG 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 5:9" />A mlung au Israel ga aja teu kelame da la,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">minadung kakga leirauta keteime.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:9">Minaleune RAMPAUBE de twa lo!<verse eid="JDG 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 5:10" />Gada kehadung reu cwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">pikampai reuga ntumbam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:10">mede lampui ge ga tet keladau, lei aide teilo,<verse eid="JDG 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 5:11" />dui kebam nidung gade dui zi kebam kwa swade ci eh.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Cikade penui RAMPAUBE masang batadung twa eh bam muila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Israel nam ga kelungme masang tadungde.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:11">Pecai RAMPAUBE minadung penui namdi kiriedung ga cailigwang di.<verse eid="JDG 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 5:12" />Mraklu, Mraklu, Deborah!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Mraklu, Mraklu, lei ge teigai lo!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:12">Culu, Barak, delwe ngu hebaangme lampui sau eh tetlu Abinoam napei.<verse eid="JDG 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 5:13" />Pecai tsaikebangme ge kedime reu ngkienglu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:13">A taiga kebam RAMPAUBE gu minadung au reugwamedung reu ngking lu.<verse eid="JDG 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 5:14" />Ephraim gade, Amalek leuhme ndaa piage kelungh deu de penuide renia;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">nah pecai, Benjamin, n minadung kakgade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">Machir gade macet kelumedung nghung lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:14">nah Zebulun gade keraube tuitie pwa kelamedung.<verse eid="JDG 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 5:15" />Issachar gade a hegwangnadung Deborah de ngngwa la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">nah Issachar Barak de ngngwala</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">langkam ge gage pe pi tet eh pecu langmpet gai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">Reuben maadung kakga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:15">dai be teizie bi penui cetlu mene bam.<verse eid="JDG 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 5:16" />Nang daitei eh miteilum kebamme da ntum bamno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">meurün kekwame meurün de kequ kwa kingnei kerane ni?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">Reuben maadung ziemne au</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:16">dai be teizie bi penui cetlu mene bam.<verse eid="JDG 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 5:17" />Gileadmedung au Jordan gwale cuikui ga bam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">dede Dan, daitei pa limdung ga lung lano?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">Asher au jaaididung kung ga lungla</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:17">nah pa pegu liemtaubamdung ga lungbamla.<verse eid="JDG 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 5:18" />Zebulun leuh au pe keringria ketsai kecang rata kebamdung ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:18">Naphtali de reutakni tei cehu kelu henidung ga la.<verse eid="JDG 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 5:19" />Hegwangmedung gwang, penui hereu tei;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">cidauting Canaan gwangpeidung au Taanach ga hereutei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">Megiddo duiletdung taiga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:19">Penui au rangkanggeu tuih kelude keu ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:16">Keu. 16:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 5:20" />Tinggimdung gade hegidung hereu tei,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:20">penui sap gade Sisera de ngngwa hereu tei.<verse eid="JDG 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 5:21" />Kishon Reuki Sisera regwamedung de diapung gidi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="JDG 5:21">Hereuki kehegwa, Kishon Reuki.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:21">Tet gwanglu, Oh a keringria, ngkieng eh!<verse eid="JDG 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 5:22" />Iciuge ge hekwen ge nginglwakdung pak nghung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:22">pak eh, pe reugwa kekuumedung pak nghung.<verse eid="JDG 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 5:23" />‘Reset punglu Meroz!’ De eh RAMPAUBE gwabe ranggai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">‘Nang cika kelungme dungde reset peu bizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">penui RAMPAUBE de ngha kera gwang kemak ne,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:23">RAMPAUBE de ngha kera mina kengkieng mede renia eh.’<verse eid="JDG 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 5:24" />Jael mipui kakgade samlam pungtu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">Kenit mepei, Heber nau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:24">paiki ga kebam mipuidung kakgade pa samlam pung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:42">Luk. 1:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 5:25" />Pa dui kiegai, pa tungdui peu, makecime ziemne hekwak keyige gage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:25">pa hetum tungdui nnwa pwagwangbeu.<verse eid="JDG 5:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 5:26" />Penui ba ketwapetlu, paiki gwak gage,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">nah pe ba zetle le hetaketeime hegeuteisang ge keraklu eh;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">pa Sisera de kedeu di, pa pe peu teipang di.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:26">Pa kedeutietlwe pe takla huidi.<verse eid="JDG 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 5:27" />Pepi kena kakga, pa keumiedi, pa kaudi, pa zeudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">Pepi kena kakga pa keumiedi, pa kau zeudi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:27">pa heni keukie kemiega, pa cika kaumie tsaidi.<verse eid="JDG 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 5:28" />Hebaki gade pa pie nghung eh hap di,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Sisera pui hebaki tsingra gade.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">‘Daitei pe bagi gwang ridi no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:28">Daitei pe hekwenbagi gwang ridi no?’<verse eid="JDG 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 5:29" />Pe hegwang napui macitumedung sam keligai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:29">dede pa pekatei pecu resiu eh bamdi;<verse eid="JDG 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 5:30" />‘Penui ngaulu meni, penui hematuikeludung nzi bamni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">releime, reugwame ket ziemne releime kena,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">Sisera paini swa kelube tui kelu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">paini swa kelube tui kelu, mamie herigaikelube,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:30">swa kelube pai lule ailam mamierau kelube pe ngwangbiet tui keludung?’<verse eid="JDG 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 5:31" />Cine, n ngauraume pelane de peu kap dilu, RAMPAUBO!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 5:31">Dede pecu hung kelame de au peu tingnaimiak kengkieng tau pet kepet nzwalu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 5:31">Iciu eh kideube ga mmi riakdai lungciep bamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 1:16">Keu. 1:16</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 5:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="JDG 6" />
  <para style="s">Gideon Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 6:1" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dwade mau lie kecube teidi, cine RAMPAUBE penuide mmi hena Midianme ba gage kaidi. <verse eid="JDG 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 6:2" />Iciu eh Midianme miekang ga Israelme lunghdi. Midianme lungh kebamne, Israel namedung au lamlwatudung ga penui ki tei eh tsupopdung ga lungh nah nsiulu kebui kedadung ga ladi. <verse eid="JDG 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 6:3" />Israelme heleuh ling luge, Midianme nah Amalekme gwangla, nah naimiak kepetle namedung de gwang pecu renia dila. <verse eid="JDG 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 6:4" />Medianme ramzeuki teilwe penuide twagwa lula nah kemdei Gaza namdi kecangde penui luh ngkap dila. Cine Israel ga lungh bamlu kebui bam sitadi, meurün, mede ketum, mede gada liede. <verse eid="JDG 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 6:5" />Medianme nah penui kauruinedung ngngwa gwang luge, penuigu paikidung si eh, penui maadi tangriem nzwa gwa nghang lula. Penui nah penui gu utdung pei kapgai kelak bam, cine penui hangdeube ga gwang cide teingkap kera teila. <verse eid="JDG 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 6:6" />Midianme kebam ziemne Israelme magah sütdi, cine Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage hapgai.<verse eid="JDG 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 6:7" />Israel namedung Midianme ziemne RAMPAUBE dage hap kegai dau, <verse eid="JDG 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 6:8" />RAMPAUBE mige de langgai, Israel namedung dage caihakecibe gede langgai beu. Pa penui dade rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang rangla: ‘Ih ne nnuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpet lu, nah Ih nnuide hebaangki gade ngngwa mpet lu. <verse eid="JDG 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 6:9" />Ih nnuide Egyptme ba gade kelilu, nah nnui de tei keherei kela pelane ba gade. Ih penuide nnui kebam gade gwadi, nah Ih penui deu pwa nnuide peudi. <verse eid="JDG 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 6:10" />Ih nnui dage rangla, “Ih RAMPAUBE, nnui Tinggwang; nnui Amoritme rabedung de reca lak, nnui penui deu ga lung kebam dau.” Dede nnui a kwa kingnei ma.’”<verse eid="JDG 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 6:11" />Cu RAMPAUBE gwabe Ophrah nam ga kebam mhubang kang ga ntumlu, cide Abiezer tsame Joash gu. Cidau Gideon, pe napei, au Midianme kebam gade mbailu kerane zaukeniak bam ga ciu neumpet bam. <verse eid="JDG 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 6:12" />Pecai RAMPAUBE gwabe pecu ngaugai eh pe dage ndugai, “RAMPAUBE ncu ngngwala, O kekuu reugwabo!” <verse eid="JDG 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 6:13" />Gideon pe dage rangdi, “Acu ngngwa lani, a kedibo? RAMPAUBE anuide ngngwalacai daitei ma aidungde pelane anuida gwang zeuno? RAMPAUBE tei kegai miswakega batadung leune daiga lano, anui paume anui dage rang keliadungde, ‘RAMPAUBE anuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpetlu meni?’ De eh rang keladung. Dede RAMPAUBE anuide püt dida delwe anuide pwa Midianme ba gage peu gai dida.” <verse eid="JDG 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 6:14" />Ge RAMPAUBE peda nreugwanglu delwe rangdi, “N kengkieng aide teu eh miecu nah nang Israel de Midianme ba gade keli luzie. Ih ncu langgai meni?” <verse eid="JDG 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 6:15" />Pecai pa pe sam keligai, “Kehereide, a mpaubo! Ih dai ciem tei eh Israel de keli beulai? Pielo, a pautsa au Manasseh gade mneitube, nah apei ki gade Ih au mneitube.” <verse eid="JDG 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 6:16" />Pecai RAMPAUBE pedage rangdi, “Kedanemene Ih ncu ngngwa lazie, nah Midianme de mina hangge de nzwa ngkap bi dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 6:17" />Pa pe dage sam keligai, “Ih n dwade n suiyi ngaulu kesang cai, iciucai a dwade nang ne a dage rang kegai rehi gade marehi ge tei gailo. <verse eid="JDG 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 6:18" />Kehereide heni aika de tetdi so, Ih nda gwanglu kemaktane iciude Ih a reca ncu teugwang beuzie nah Ih cide n dwaga kai beuzie.” Cine pa rangdi, “Akatei, Ih bam luzie nang cailigwang kemaktane.”<verse eid="JDG 6:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 6:19" />Pecai Gideon tetdi nah hemeuna ge teleilu delwe tokkui ephah ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram kerei nsam ge</char></note> cehi kaikemak tangku rulu. Pa raptui ge gage hetei kailu nah lige gage hetei gidui kailwe mhu bang kangga cide pwa gwanglu, delwe pa cidungde peugai. <verse eid="JDG 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 6:20" />Pecai Tinggwang gwabe peda ge rangdi, “Heteih de nah cehi kaikemak tangku de pwalu delwe cide tangtsu aide reu ge kailu, delwe gidui de ruigai,” dege pa cide teigai. <verse eid="JDG 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 6:21" />Pecai RAMPAUBE gwabe pe ba ga kebam tuitie ketwapet gai. Pa heteih nah tsehikaikemak tangku de tunggai; tangtsu gade mi heucudi delwe heteih nah cehi kaikemak tangku de rudi. Pecai RAMPAUBE gwabe pa kengau gade tetdi. <verse eid="JDG 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 6:22" />Gideon au cipaude RAMPAUBE gwabe kecu ngau luge, Gideon hapdi, “Hei, a mpaube RAMPAUBO, aide ziemne Ih RAMPAUBE gwabe de kezumok eh ngauda!” <verse eid="JDG 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 6:23" />Dede RAMPAUBE pedage sam keligai, “Helungkenciep nda lalu! Ngngi diso, nang tsaidi lak.” <verse eid="JDG 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 6:24" />Gideon cikade RAMPAUBE dage recabam ge teigai nah pa cide de RAMPAUBE au lungciep lie msiak gai. Henai kecang de Abiezer pautsa deu ga Ophrah ga cide sap bam.<verse eid="JDG 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 6:25" />Cipau ziu de RAMPAUBE pedage ranggai, “N pei gu hetumseuna de teulu, nah hetumseu kenabe de mmi hena kedide, n pei gu Baal recabam de tei kecai di, delwe cide taiga kebam Asherah de bikaudi. <verse eid="JDG 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 6:26" />Nang RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang dage aipau nsiulu kela heni peutwang gage teleibeu kela nzwa reca bam ge tei beu zie. Pecai nang hetumseu pe kenabe de keulu nah pelane pwa keru ratak teibeu zie, nang bikaudi kera Asherah tsingpakdung reu gage.” <verse eid="JDG 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 6:27" />Cine Gideon pe kilamedung kakgade mina hangkerei ngngwalwe RAMPAUBE rangkebeude nzwa tei di. Pa cide tingna tei kera pe pei kelak nah namdi cika kebamme de kehingne, pa cide tingmui teidi.<verse eid="JDG 6:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 6:28" />Namdi cika minadung tingcang nuge cuh luge, nah Baal recabamde tei kecai kedi, petaiga Asherah de bikau kedi, nah hetumseu pe kenabede recabam tei kelude gage recabeu kedi ngaulu. <verse eid="JDG 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 6:29" />Cine, hange ge kecu pe kidabe dage rangdi, “Caune aide tei no?” Penui keteu nah peei kechung ge, penui rangdi, “Gideon, Joash napei ne ma aide tei lie.” <verse eid="JDG 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 6:30" />Pecai namdi ga minadung Joash dage rangdi, “N napei de teu mpetlu pecu teitsetlu kerane, kedanemene pa Baal recabam tei kecai dida, nah cipau tai Asherah de bikau dide lu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 6:31" />Joash pecu sap eh mmau kebam pelane dage rangdi, “Nnui Baal keleu gade renia lubui ni? Nnui pecu ngha kesang zie ni? Pe ziemne renia kelame keheibede cu tingcang ting gage teitset di zie. Pa au rabe ge liecai, peu pecu mnung lulo mige pe recabam teikau kedi dau.” <verse eid="JDG 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 6:32" />Cine cipaunai pa pecu “Jerub Baal,” lie qu di, rang eh, “Peu Baal de pecu mmaulu,” kedanemene pa pegu recabam de teikaudi didelu.<verse eid="JDG 6:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 6:33" />Aipau cai Midianme, Amalekme, nah kepetle namedung pelane ngkwalu delwe kahpet Jezreel langkam gage ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="JDG 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 6:34" />Dede RAMPAUBE Rabe Gideon de gumlu. Cine pa teluibe kwagai, iciu eh pa Abiezer de qulu. <verse eid="JDG 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 6:35" />Pecai pa Manasseh pelane gage samgwame langgai, nah pa pecu de peu suilu. Pa Asher, Zebulun, nah Naphtali gade samgwame langgai, nah penuide redau kerane penui hangdi.<verse eid="JDG 6:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 6:36" />Pecai Gideon Tinggwang kesangbe dage rangdi, “Nang a ba le teu Israel de kelibeu zielie bam cai, nang rang kegai nzwa, <verse eid="JDG 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 6:37" />pielo, Ih mamai pai aide hecaipung gage kai gaila. Magade mamai pai cide reuga rünne hezin hwacai, dede hangdeu pelane canghcai, iciucai nang a bale pwa Israel de kelibeu kera Ih cilu zie, nang rang kegai nzwa eh.” <verse eid="JDG 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 6:38" />Pecai benai pa nuge cuhlu, nah pa mamai pai de tuigai. Pa mamai pai gade hezin tuimpet lu, cide duikwakde puilu. <verse eid="JDG 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 6:39" />Pecai Gideon Tinggwang kesangbe dage rangdi, “N rata de peu acu mmau eh rudi so, dede Ih henai pia rünne ranglu bui mi. Henai pia rünne Ih mamai pai teu kedei lubui mi? Ih kiela, peu mamai pai reuga rünne canglu, dede hangdeu pelane peu hezin keilu.” <verse eid="JDG 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 6:40" />Cine Tinggwang cipau ziu de aide teigai. Mamai pai reuga rünne cangh bam, dede hangdeu pelane ga hezin bamdi.<verse eid="JDG 6:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="JDG 7" />
  <para style="s">Gideon Medianme de ngamkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 7:1" />Pecai Jerubbaal (cide Gideon), cuh zilu, nah pecu ngngwa kela mina pelane, nah penui Harod duilet taiga ramzeuki teilu. Midianme ramzeuki au penreule bam, langkam ga Moreh deutu lambie.<verse eid="JDG 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 7:2" />RAMPAUBE Gideon dade rangdi, “Ih penui ba gage Midianme de peugai kera ncu ngngwa kelame kieezu dida, iciucai Israelme a nreu kendu ngaupwa dizie, rang eh, ‘Akatei a ba ne acu kelilu.’ <verse eid="JDG 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 7:3" />Cu ciziemne, minadung kwen gage rang eh reci beulu, ‘Ngngi nah mbeu kebam keheibe de, pecu peu caili dilu nah Gilead Deutu gade tet dilu.’” Cine mina cang ngkaiekena caili di, dede cang kerei bamdi.<verse eid="JDG 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 7:4" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Gideon dade rangdi, “Cude minadung au kie ham zeu reu. Penuide dui ga ngngwa mie lu, iciude Ih penuide nziemne keustam beuzie. Cine keheibe de de Ih ne rang kecume, ‘Aide ncu ngngwa mie zie,’ pa ncu ngngwa mie zie. Dede Ih ndade, ‘Aide ncu ngngwa mie lak,’ de rang kebeu keheibede pa mie lak.” <verse eid="JDG 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 7:5" />Cine pa minadungde dui ga ngngwa nghung lu, nah RAMPAUBE au Gideon dade rangdi, “Pe nleu le heteu nzwa dui gade nrop kecume de, nang pecu keutsam dizie, dui nrop kerane pe ngkokpui ga koktung kemie me de cinzwa keutsam luzie.” <verse eid="JDG 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 7:6" />Penui bale pwalwe penui muile nrop kecume mina hai cum, dede mina kedadung pelane au dui sak kerane penui nkok koktungmie. <verse eid="JDG 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 7:7" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Gideon dage rangdi, “Mina dui nrop kecu hai cum de ngngwa eh, Ih ncu ngha beuzie nah Midian pwa n ba ga ge peudi zie. Cine mina kedadung de peu pe bam riep ga cailigwang dilu.” <verse eid="JDG 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 7:8" />Pecai minadung penui ba gage mania nah penui teluidung pwalu dede Israelme kedadung de pa langgi di, penui paiki riep gage, pa kaizeukelu mina hai cum de gwale. Midianme ramzeuki au Gideon ngkang langkam ga bam.<verse eid="JDG 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 7:9" />Cipau ziu de RAMPAUBE pe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu! Ramzeuki ga nghung cu, kedanemene Ih pecu n ba gage kaibeu dida. <verse eid="JDG 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 7:10" />Dede nang magade nghung kera ngngi cai, n reunet kepwabe Purah de ngngwalwe nang ramzeuki ga nghung lubui, <verse eid="JDG 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 7:11" />nah nang penui daipai rang bambi siuzie, nah kekamle n ba kena teinkeing beuzie nah nang ramzeuki de renia kera nghung zie.” Cine pa nghung di, pa nah pe reunet kepwabe Purah, ramzeuki mina riakngei kebam tün ga. <verse eid="JDG 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 7:12" />Midianme, Amalekme, nah naimiak kepetle leuhme pelane langkam ga zeu bam, tangriem maaga nzwa kiee süt bam. Penui gu utdung au pei kap gailak, jaaidi kunga heciangdung nzwa. <verse eid="JDG 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 7:13" />Gideon gwanglu, ge ainie, mige pe kidabe dage hemang ge siaklia bam. Pa rangdi, “Ainie, Ih hemang ge mmi, nah ainie, barley tangkukwak kengwage Midianme ramzeuki ga mluimie la. Cide paiki dei ge ga mie, nah cide hangdeu ga kau taksu di nah ramzeuki kau zeudi.” <verse eid="JDG 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 7:14" />Pe kidabe samkeli eh rangdi, “Aide ma keda meda, aide Israelme pei, Joash napei, Gideon kingtie zielie maige. Tinggwang Midianme de pwa pe ba ga ge peu dida nah ramzeuki pelane.”<verse eid="JDG 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 7:15" />Gideon hemang siak kegaide, nah cide kie rang kegaide siu luge, pa RAMPAUBE da keumie eh reca di. Pa Israelme ramzeuki ga cailigwang rangdi, “Cuh lu! RAMPAUBE ne Midianme ramzeuki nnui ba gage kaibeu dide kecune.” <verse eid="JDG 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 7:16" />Pecai pa mina hai cum de nzi pwa maa kecum teilu, nah pa telui pwa pelane ba gage kaibeu mabung kenrwa be de si eh, mabungdung lungga mipakdung de si eh. <verse eid="JDG 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 7:17" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui acu pielwe cinzwa teizie. Pielu! Ih ramzeuki tu ga gwang keladau, cide kesiak ge nnuide tei maisia. <verse eid="JDG 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 7:18" />Ih telui kwa gaide, Ih nah acu ngngwa kela leune, nnui telui kwa gai zie, nnui ramzeuki twagwa kebam leune de. Pecai nnui sahbak gai zie, ‘RAMPAUBE ziemne nah Gideon ziemne!’”<verse eid="JDG 7:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 7:19" />Cine Gideon nah pecu nzang kela mina haige ramzeuki kung ga gwanglu, muisum kekwame kedet tingdau. Kekwame penui bamga bam luge, penui telui kwagai, nah penui ba ga kela mabungdung kediang gai. <verse eid="JDG 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 7:20" />Pecai hemaa kecum de teluidung kwagai nah penui mabungdung rütpok gai. Penui ba hile heleikidung teula nah kwagai kerane penui ba zetle teluidung la. Penui sahbak gai, “Anui RAMPAUBE nah Gideon ziemne kingtie ge.” <verse eid="JDG 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 7:21" />Hange ge kecu pe sap ga ramzeuki de twagwa ge ramzeuki gade pelane pakdi. Penui sahbak eh pakdi. <verse eid="JDG 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 7:22" />Penui telui hai cum de kwagai ge, ramzeuki ga kebam pelane de RAMPAUBE ne mi hange ge kecude peu pe zangbe de kerebi. Cine reugwame Zererah lambie Beth Shittah dei ge pak miedi, Tabbath lambie Abel Meholah tu kemdei ga kecang. <verse eid="JDG 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 7:23" />Pecai Israelme Naphtali nah Asher gade, nah Manasseh pelane gade qu hekwalu, nah penui Midianme de zuimie.<verse eid="JDG 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 7:24" />Gideon samgwame de kideutu deudi Ephraim pelane gage de langgai eh ranggai, “Midian de kemcwale nghunglu nah Beth Berah ga kebam Jordan Reuki gade tuilu.” Iciu eh Ephraimme pelane de qu hekwalwe tuilu Beth Barah nah Jordan Reuki kecang ga. <verse eid="JDG 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 7:25" />Penui Medianme hegwangna hangna de tuih lu, Oreb nah Zeeb. Penui Oreb de Oreb tsura gade teitsetdi, nah penui Zeeb de Zeeb zauniakbam gade teitsetdi. Penui Midian de zuimie nah penui Oreb penai Zeeb peu Gideon da teu gwang beudi, Jordan gwale gade.<verse eid="JDG 7:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="JDG 8" />
  <para style="s">Zebah penai Zalmunna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 8:1" />Ephraimmedung ne Gideon dage keteu, “Nang anui dage daipai teigai dino, nang Midianme de regi kecudau anuide qugai mene?” Penui pecu cisüt eh mmaudi. <verse eid="JDG 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 8:2" />Gideon penui dage keligai, “Nnui kecet gade Ih cu daipai tei dino? Ephraim gade kubetsi pahekwa kecu swa Abiezer luh gade kubetsi luhlüt kelube yiki meni? <verse eid="JDG 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 8:3" />Tinggwang ne Midianme hegwangna de nnui ba gage kai beu dida, Oreb penai Zeeb! Cine nnuide rang keda kegai Ih daipai teilu dino?” Pa sam aide rang kegaidau penui zai henah miedi.<verse eid="JDG 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 8:4" />Pecai Gideon Jordan Reuki ga gwanglu, delwe pa nah pecu ngngwa kela mina hai cum de, kahpetlu. Penui leudi, dede penui ngauraume de zui, jüja miedi. <verse eid="JDG 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 8:5" />Pecai pa Succoth nam ga minadung dage rangdi, “Acu ngngwa kelamedung de kehereide tangkukwak kenggwabedung peulo, penui leu kedine, iciude Ih Midianme gwangpei kena Zebah penai Zalmunna de gwa zui zie reulu.” <verse eid="JDG 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 8:6" />Succoth gwangnadung sam keligai, “Zebah penai Zalmunna badeu cu n ba ga bamdi deni anui n reugwame de tangku peu maisia kedi?” <verse eid="JDG 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 8:7" />Cine Gideon mdugai, “Kesang RAMPAUBE Zebah penai Zalmunna de a ba gage kai kebeu dau, Ih hetaideu ga hetudung nah hetuhwadung le tsingriadung tei zie cidung de teu ncu dap kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 8:8" />Pecai penui cikade tet pwa Penuel nam ga gwangdi nah ainzwa eh penui dage de rangdi, dede Penuel nam ga minadung Succoth nam ga minadung nzwasiak kelidi. <verse eid="JDG 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 8:9" />Cine pa Peniel nam ga minadung dage de rangdi, “Ih kezuyi teu caili kegwangdau, Ih reketbam aide teukau dizie.”<verse eid="JDG 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 8:10" />Cu Zebah penai Zalmunna Karkor namdi ga la nah penai reugwamedung penai de ngngwa la, cang kereimengei kenzwage, naimiak kepetle leuhmedung ramzeuki gwale kela kebangbe pelane, reugwame tsai kedime 120,000. <verse eid="JDG 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 8:11" />Pecai Gideon paikidung ga lungh kebammedung lampui ga hangdi, Nobah nam penai Jogbehah nam gade naimiak kepetle. Pa ramzeuki de gwaketang, ramzeuki be kwak kebam dau. <verse eid="JDG 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 8:12" />Zebah penai Zalmunna pakdi, dede pa penai de zuimie delwe Midianme gwangpei kena Zebah penai Zalmunna de tuilu. Iciu eh pa ramzeuki pelane de peu hing eh mbeudi.<verse eid="JDG 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 8:13" />Pecai Gideon, Joash napei, hereu gade cailidi, Heres ga kehang lampui de pwa eh. <verse eid="JDG 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 8:14" />Pa Succoth gade rehangme ge de tuilu nah pa pecu keteu. Pa pe ziemne Succoth gwangnadung nah cika hangkiamedung zi rau beu, mina riak hena-hena. <verse eid="JDG 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 8:15" />Pecai pa Succoth ga minadung da gwanglwe rangdi, “Zebah penai Zalmunna de pie gailo, penai ha rang eh nnui acu henuitei, ‘Zebah penai Zalmunna badeu cu n ba ga bam deni anui n reugwame leu eh kelame de tangku peu kera.’” <verse eid="JDG 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 8:16" />Pa namdibe hangkiamedung de nah hetaideu ga hetudung nah hetuhwadung keulu, delwe pa Succoth ga minadung de cidung de teu tei kehereigai. <verse eid="JDG 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 8:17" />Pecai pa Peniel reketbam de tei kau di nah pa namdi ga minadung de teitsetdi.<verse eid="JDG 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 8:18" />Pecai pa Zebah penai Zalmunna dage rangdi, “Nnui Tabor deutu gade teitset kedimedung daikenzwa kaudung geno?” Penui keligai, “Penuide nang nzwa lei. Hange ge kecu hegwangpei namedung nzwa.” <verse eid="JDG 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 8:19" />Cine pa rangdi, “Penui au a sinamedung, apui napeidung lei. RAMPAUBE ring kela nzwa, nnui peu penuide ringla lie cai Ih nnuide teitset dilak nage.” <verse eid="JDG 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 8:20" />Pecai pa peneraibe Jether dage ranggai, “Cuhlu, penuide teitsetdi!” Dede rehangbe pe kingtie zütmpet ma pa ngngi kedine, pa au rehangna ge reu kecune. <verse eid="JDG 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 8:21" />Pecai Zebah penai Zalmunna rangdi, “Nang nkatei cuhlwe anui reuga kaumie culo! Mige pe katei pe kengkieng bam kesang kecume ge nzwa.” Cine Gideon cuhlu delwe Zebah penai Zalmunna de teitsetdi. Pa hekeipetrwana-rehi kenzwa henetdungde penai utdung ngwang ga kebam dung de keulu.<verse eid="JDG 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Cingkupei Gideon gu hekeutupai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 8:22" />Pecai Israelmedung Gideon dage rangdi, “Anui reu kedi tei lulo, nang nah n napei hangna na, nah n napei kecangde, nang anuide Midianme ba gade kelibeu kecune.” <verse eid="JDG 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 8:23" />Dede Gideon penai dage rangdi, “Ih nnui reu kedi teilak, a napei de nnui reu di lak, RAMPAUBE ne nnui reu dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 8:24" />Pecai Gideon penui dage rangdi, “Acu peu nnui dade mage kie lo, nnui hange ge kecu hema tui kelu gade nli ge ramcau acu peu lo.” Penui au Ishmael leuhme kecune kecak nlidung teula. <verse eid="JDG 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 8:25" />Penui sam keligai, “Anui cidungde peu bi zie.” Cine penui pai kamlu delwe hangge ge kecu cikage pe matui kelu gade nli keliengai beu. <verse eid="JDG 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 8:26" />Pa kie kegai kecak nlidung perüt cang ge haihena, hekeipetrwa-rehi netdung, teizudung, nah Midianme gwangpeidung teu kela swa gie kelu paidung de si, nah pecaide penui utdung ngwang ga kela heteiriadung de si. <verse eid="JDG 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 8:27" />Pecai Gideon cide teu hekeutupai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:27 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cingku kedibe kai kela kemci nia ge</char></note> ge teilu delwe cide pe namdi Ophrah gage kailu, ge Israelme pelane cide de cikade gwang reca di. Cide Gideon nah pe kelak ziemne hetak ge di.<verse eid="JDG 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Gideon tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 8:28" />Cine Israel namedung ne Midianme de gwalu nah penui au gwazuilu tadi. Cine penui deu ga Gideon ting mmi riakdai ge lungciep bamlu.<verse eid="JDG 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 8:29" />Jerubbaal,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gideon</char></note> Joash napei mie pe ki ga lunghdi. <verse eid="JDG 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 8:30" />Gideon pe napei peda de lunggwang kelume riakhena bam, pa pe nau kekiee ge kebamne. <verse eid="JDG 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 8:31" />Pe nauseupui, Shechem ga kebam de, pecu mipeina ge mna beu, nah pa pezi Abimelech msiaklu. <verse eid="JDG 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 8:32" />Gideon, Joash napei, hecing süt eh tsaidi nah pecu pe pei Joash rau gage kungdi, cide Abiezer pautsa deu Ophrah ga bam.<verse eid="JDG 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 8:33" />Gideon tsaidi ge, Israelme baaldung de reca eh RAMPAUBE dage kemau teigai daidi. Penui Baal Berith de pwa penui rabe ge teidi. <verse eid="JDG 8:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 8:34" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE, penui Tinggwang de nsungtadi, penuide twagwa pung kebam penui ngauraume pelane ba gade penuide kelikebeube de. <verse eid="JDG 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 8:35" />Penui Jerubbaal, Gideon, kelak dage kesamsang lialu tadi, pa Israel lungga heta keyi tei kegai nzwa.<verse eid="JDG 8:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="JDG 9" />
  <para style="s">Abimelech Shechem reu kedibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 9:1" />Aipaucai Abimelech, Jerubbaal<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gideon</char></note> napei Shechem ga mie pe pui heimedung nah pa pe pui kibaume kelak pelane dage marang eh ranggai, <verse eid="JDG 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 9:2" />“Shechem ga deuketme pelane kwen gage ngaungia eh ranggai beulo, ‘Daide be nnui ziemne yino, Jerubbaal napeidung pelane, mina riakhena nnui reu keditei kecube mi, mi hangge nnui reu keditei bam kecube beno?’ Ih au nnui ra nah nnui teihjai lie kecu nsung lulo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 9:3" />Pe pui heimedung pe keleu gade ma aidungde pelane pwa Shechem deuketme pelane dage ranggai, nah penui nlungdung Abimelech da nreu gwang eh penui rangdi, “Pa au anui sinabe.” <verse eid="JDG 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 9:4" />Pecai penui Baal Berith kerecaki gade pecu rangkanggeu riakhena peugai, nah Abimelech cide teu kemta nah samzai kegahme de lilu, cine penui pe caisui gwang. <verse eid="JDG 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 9:5" />Pecai pa Ophrah ga pe pei kelak da mie di, nah pa pe sinamedung, Jerubbaal namedung de teitsetdi, tangtsukang ge reu gage mipei riakhena de. Dede Jotham de bangbeu, Jerubbaal napei henatube, pa mbai kedine. <verse eid="JDG 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 9:6" />Pecai Shechem ga deuketme pelane nah Beth Millo ga mina pelane gwang ngkwalu nah penui mie Shechem ga tsusum ge taiga mhu bang pi gade Abimelech de hegwangpei kedetlu.<verse eid="JDG 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 9:7" />Jotham cipau ha de siu luge, pa Gerizim deutu twang ga saplu. Pa pekwa sahbak eh nah hap eh penui dage rangdi, “A kwa kingnei gailo, Shechem ga deuketme, iciude Tinggwang nnui kwa kingnei luzie. <verse eid="JDG 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 9:8" />Piage tsingbangdung penui reu hegwangpei ge keniaklu kerane mlaicu. Cine penui Olive bang dage rangdi, ‘Anui gwangpei lulo.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 9:9" />Dede Olive bang penui dage keligai, ‘Ih a ca capet mede ni, cidau acu teu penui herabedung de nah mina rüt gwang, Ih mie tsingbang reu ga ruigai maisia dini?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 9:10" />Cine tsingbangdung tangzüttsi bang dage rangdi, ‘Nang gwanglu! Anui gwangpei lulo.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 9:11" />Dede tangzüttsi bang penui dage rangdi, ‘Ih a kekum nah a tsi keyi bui beu mede ni, iciu eh Ih mie tsingbang reu gui maisia di deni?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 9:12" />Pecai tsingbangdung kubebang dage rangdi, ‘Nang gwanglu! Anui gwangpei lulo.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 9:13" />Pecai kubebang penui dage rangdi, ‘Ih a zauci, cide herabedung nah mina suiyi teibeu kelade bui mtak deni Ih mie tsingbang reu gui maisia di deni?’ <verse eid="JDG 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 9:14" />Pecai tsingbang pelane hetuziu dage rangdi, ‘Nang gwanglu, anui gwangpei lulo.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 9:15" />Hetuziu tsingbangdung dage rangdi, ‘Magade nnui acu nnui reu gwangpei kera keniak kesang cai, gwanglu, a mie kang ga kemsiu peeilu. Dede magade mecai, hetupui gade peu mi heu pet eh Lebanon ga cedar bangdung de ru dilo.’ <verse eid="JDG 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 9:16" />Ciziemne, cu nnui kesangbe nah lungsang gade Abimelech de hegwang kelang kelu tei luda cai nah nnui Jerubbaal ziemne nah pe kelak ha de petau lie lacai, nah pe bata tei kegai rehi nzwa nnui pe dage tei gai lie lacai, <verse eid="JDG 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 9:17" />a pei nnui keleu gade regi, nah pe teilung hedwa kecang gage de kaibeu, pa nnuide Midianme ba gade kelilu kebeu dau, <verse eid="JDG 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 9:18" />dede henai nnui a pei kelak de renia cuh dida nah pe napeidungde, mipei riakhena de, tangtsukang ket reu gage teitset dida. Pecai nnui Abimelech, pe kilapui napei gede, Shechem ga deuketme gwangpei kelang luda, pa au nnui sinabe kecune. <verse eid="JDG 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 9:19" />Cu Henai nnui Jerubbaal dade nah pe kelak dade kesangbe nah lungsang gade aide tei luda cai, Abimelech ha aide nnui suiyi lu, nah pa pekatei de nnui ziemne pe suiyi luzie. <verse eid="JDG 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 9:20" />Dede mecai, Abimelech dade mi heupet zie nah cide Shechem nah Beth Millo ga deuketme de rudi zie. Shechem nah Beth Millo ga deuketme dade mi heupet zie nah cide Abimelech de rudi zie.” <verse eid="JDG 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 9:21" />Pecai Jotham pakdi, delwe pa Beer namdi ga miedi. Pa pe sinabe Abimelech dade kemdei ga cika lungh ladi.<verse eid="JDG 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 9:22" />Cu Abimelech au Israel reu mmi kecum hegwang tei. <verse eid="JDG 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 9:23" />Pecai Tinggwang herakesiabe ge langpwa Abimelech penai Shechem ga deuketme kakgage teigai ciu eh shechem ga deuketme Abimelech de cwa lu kerane, <verse eid="JDG 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 9:24" />Jerubbaal napei riakhena dage tei gai kedi nah penui sinabe Abimelech, penui de teitset kedibe, nah pe sinamedung de teitset kerane pe ba kena tei ngkieng kebeu Shechem ga deuketme reu gage penui jai kekai zaisiet ta tei kegai de pie cailidai gai. <verse eid="JDG 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 9:25" />Cine Shechem ga deuketme kideutu peutwangdung ga mina de kaipwa pe lampui swa lu. Penui lampui ga kah kegwang leune gu sütlu, nah cide Abimelech dage ranggai beudi.<verse eid="JDG 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 9:26" />Pecai Gaal, Ebed napei pe sinamedung de nzang eh gwang nah penui Shechem ga mie. Shechem ga deuketme pecu nlumlu. <verse eid="JDG 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 9:27" />Penui luh ga tetmie delwe penui luh gade kubetsi railu, nah cide penui tuilu. Penui luhlüt ngyi hengyilu nah penui penui herabedung kerecaki ga mie, pecai penui matei nah penui sak, delwe penui Abimelech de reset. <verse eid="JDG 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 9:28" />Pecai, Ebed napei Gaal rangdi, “Abimelech cau no? Nah Shechem cau no, anui pegwa tei kera? Pa Jerubbaal napei me ni nah Zebul pecu kenghabe meni? Shechem namdi bangdwame, Hamor leuhme gwa teilu. Anuikatei daitei anui pegwa tei laino? <verse eid="JDG 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 9:29" />Caune mina aidungde pwa a ba gage kaibeu zie no? Iciude Ih Abimelech de langgi dizie. Pa Abimelech dage rangdi, ‘N reugwame tei ngkiee lwe petlu.’”<verse eid="JDG 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 9:30" />Zebul, namdibe ga hegwangna, Ebed napei Gaal sam cide siu luge, pe rata sütdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 9:31" />Cine pa ngkim eh Abimelech dage samgwame langgai, “Pielo, Ebed napei Gaal nah pe sinamedung Shechem ga gwang lada, nah ainie, penui au ncu mmau eh namdibe lung tei bamdida. <verse eid="JDG 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 9:32" />Ciziemne, cu, tingmui gage cuhlu, nang nah mina ncu ngngwa kebamme, delwe mie luh ga mbai eh swalu. <verse eid="JDG 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 9:33" />Iciude, cide gwang zie, tingcang, naimiak cuh kecu dau, nang tetpet zi lu delwe zangpet eh namdibe de ketanglu. Pielo, pa nah pecu ngngwa kela minadung nda gwang kela dau, nang pedage n bata nzwa teilu buisiak be tei gailu.”<verse eid="JDG 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 9:34" />Cine Abimelech nah pecu ngngwa kelame mina pelane tingmui cuhlu, nah penui shechem lampui swalu. Penui maa mdai teilu. <verse eid="JDG 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 9:35" />Ebed napei Gaal tet mpet eh namdibe rieki kelüt ga sap kwalu. Pecai Abimelech nah mina pecu ngngwa kelamedung swa kebam gade cuhlu. <verse eid="JDG 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 9:36" />Gaal minadung de ngaulu ge, pa Zebul dage rangdi, “Ainie, minamaadung hangdeutu twang tai gade nghung lada!” Zebul pedage rangdi, “Nang hangdeutudung mie mina nzwa ngaubam.” <verse eid="JDG 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 9:37" />Pecai Gaal, rang si eh rangdi, “Ainie, minamaadung hangdeutu twang tai gade nghung lada, nah maa ge au rekame gu mhu bang lampui gade gwang lada.” <verse eid="JDG 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 9:38" />Pecai Zebul pedage rangdi, “Iciucai sui daiga n mui bam no, cide teu eh nang rangdi, ‘Abimelech cau no anui pe gwa tei kera?’ Minadung aidungde nang ngaurau kecumedung meni? Kesang, cu tetpet pecu regi lo.” <verse eid="JDG 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 9:39" />Cine Gaal Shechem ga deuketme dwaga tetpet di, nah pa Abimelech de ngngwa regi. <verse eid="JDG 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 9:40" />Abimelech pecu zuimie, nah pa pe dade pakdi. Mina kekieege namdibe rieki kenlüt ga kecang rezam msia sütdi.<verse eid="JDG 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 9:41" />Pecai Abimelech Arumah nam ga lunghdi. Zebul ne Gaal de nah pe sinamedung de Shechem ga lungh kebam gade gwagi di. <verse eid="JDG 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 9:42" />Cu cide tei kedi pecai benai minadung luh ga mie pet, delwe penui cide Abimelech dage pau beu. <verse eid="JDG 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 9:43" />Cine pa minadung de ngngwalu delwe penuide maa cum teilu. Pecai pa luh ga swalwe kwabam. Pa piegai eh minadung namdibe gade tet pet kezeu ngau luge, pecai pa mbai kebam gade cuhlu delwe penuide renia eh pa penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 9:44" />Abimelech nah hemaa pecu ngngwa kebamdung zangpet eh penui namdibe rieki kelüt ga sap. Dede hemaa kena mina luh ga kebam leune de renia eh penui penuide teitsetdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 9:45" />Abimelech cipaunai tingbazie pelane namdibe de ngngwa regi. Pa namdi de tuilu, nah pa minadung cika kebamme de teitsetdi. Pecai pa namdibe teu kaudi delwe cikage mcai tei zang gaidi.<verse eid="JDG 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 9:46" />Shechem reketbam mpaumedung pelane siu luge, penui El-Berith kengkieng reketbam ki ga nlütdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 9:47" />Pecai Shechem reketbam mpaume pelane gwang ngkwa kelu abimelech dage paubeu. <verse eid="JDG 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 9:48" />Cine Abimelech Zalmon Deutu ga nghanglu, pa nah pecu ngngwa kelame leune. Abimelech mreu ge pe ba gage pwalwe tsingbang gade pekiak ge bilu. Pa cide pwa cuhlwe pe hekeutu reu gage kailwe pecu ngngwa kebamme dage rangdi, “Ih tei kegai de nnui kengau leune, kelwalu, Ih nzwa tei lu.” <verse eid="JDG 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="JDG 9:49" />Cine mina leune tsingkiak ramcau bilu delwe penui Abimelech caisuidi. Pecai penui cidungde hangdeukang bung reu gage keswalu, iciu eh penui ziemne mi pwa hangdeukang bung de rugai. Cine Shechem reketbam ga mina kemlang pelane de tsaidi mipui nah mipei cangge kenzwa ge.<verse eid="JDG 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="JDG 9:50" />Pecai Abimelech Thebez nam ga miedi, nah pa Thebez nam ga ramzeuki tei twagwalu delwe pa cide tuilu. <verse eid="JDG 9:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="JDG 9:51" />Dede namdibe sumga kengkieng reketbam bamla, cine mipei mipui pelane nah namdibe ga kemlangme deuketme pelane cika ge pak gaidi. Penui penuikatei caile de cide ngkuidi delwe penui reketbam reuga hangdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="JDG 9:52" />Pecai Abimelech renei be lambie gwang nah pa cide ngngwa regi, nah pa cide mi le rudi kerane reketbam kimui ga kecang gwang. <verse eid="JDG 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="JDG 9:53" />Dede mipui hangge ne keniaktsu ge Abimelech peu gage kelien gai nah cide pepeura teipang di. <verse eid="JDG 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="JDG 9:54" />Pecai pa pe reunet pwa kela rehangpei dage sah mzet gai, delwe pa pe dage rangdi, “N kingtie zütlwe acu teitset di, mecai penui a ha rang zie, ‘Mipui ge ne pecu teitset dilie eh.’” Cine pe rehangpei ne pecu reutset di. <verse eid="JDG 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="JDG 9:55" />Israel ga minadung Abimelech tsai kedi ngau luge, penui bamriep ga gwangdi. <verse eid="JDG 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="JDG 9:56" />Iciu eh Tinggwang Abimelech pe siname riakhena de teitset eh pa pe pei dage kemau tei kegaide ziemne hekum peidi. <verse eid="JDG 9:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="JDG 9:57" />Shechemme kemau teikedi pelane ziemne Tinggwang penui reu gage saja peu. Nah, penui reu Jerubbaal napei Jotham reset de tei gwanglu.<verse eid="JDG 9:57" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="JDG 10" />
  <para style="s">Tola Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 10:1" />Abimelech tsai kedicai, Tola, Puah napei, Dodo tsapei, Issachar leuhme ge, Israelme de kelilu kerane muiteu teilu. Pa Shamir nam ga lunghla, kideutu deudi Ephraim ga. <verse eid="JDG 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 10:2" />Pa mmi ngkaiekecum Israel tutiak. Pa tsaidi nah pecu Shamir gage kungdi.<verse eid="JDG 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jair Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 10:3" />Pecai Gileadme Jair pecai cuhlu. Pa mmi ngkaiekena Israel tutiak. <verse eid="JDG 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 10:4" />Pa pena mipei camrei bam, gadadung camrei reu cwa eh. Penui ziemne namdidung camrei bamla, penui cidungde henai kecangde Havvoth Jair lie qula, cidungde Gilead deu ga bam. <verse eid="JDG 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 10:5" />Pecai Jair tsaidi nah pecu Kamon nam gage kungdi.<verse eid="JDG 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ammonme ne Israel de nneu kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 10:6" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dwade kemau tei jüja ladi: penui Baaldung de reca, nah Ashtorethdung nah Aram rabedung, nah Sidon rabedung, nah Moab rabedung, nah Ammon namedung rabedung, nah Philistinme rabedung. Penui RAMPAUBE de gidi nah pe gwatei ma. <verse eid="JDG 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 10:7" />RAMPAUBE Israel de pe rata sütdi, cine pa penuide Philistinme ba gage kaidi nah Ammon namedung ba gage. <verse eid="JDG 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 10:8" />Penui cipau kumde Israel namedung de, nah mmi kereieheset ge Israel name pelane Jordan Reuki kemcwa gwale Gilead ga kebam Amoritme deu ga kelungme pelane teimsia nah tei kehereidi. <verse eid="JDG 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 10:9" />Pecai Ammon namedung de Judah de regi kerane Jordan kahpet lu, Benjamin de renia kera, nah Ephraim kelak de renia kera nah cine Israel ziemne keherei süt kecu ge teidi.<verse eid="JDG 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 10:10" />Pecai Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage hap gai eh ranggai, “Anui ndage kemau teigai dida, kedanemene anui au anui Tinggwang de gidi eh Baaldung gwa teidi kedine.” <verse eid="JDG 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 10:11" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Israel namedung dage rangdi, “Egyptme dade meni, nah Ammoritme dade nah Ammon namedung dade, nah Philistinme dade, <verse eid="JDG 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 10:12" />nah Sidonme nah Amalekme nah Maonme dade, penui nnuide teikeherei gai eh nnui a dage mrah kegai dau, nah penui ba gade Ih nnuide keli beu meni? <verse eid="JDG 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 10:13" />Dede nnui acu pütdi eh keda rabedung gwatei dida. Ciziemne, Ih nnuide kelibeu si lakta. <verse eid="JDG 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 10:14" />Mie eh nnui kedetkelu rabedung dage hapgai lulo. Penui nnui keherei keludau keli beu kerabe.” <verse eid="JDG 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 10:15" />Pecai Israel namedung RAMPAUBE dage rangdi, “Anui kemau tei dida. Nang anui dage n dwade keyibe leune teigai lulo. Dede kehereide henai anuide keli beulo.” <verse eid="JDG 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 10:16" />Penui kakgade sangme rabedung de keugidi delwe penui RAMPAUBE de recadi. Pecai pa Israel reide ziemne Pe lung siadi.<verse eid="JDG 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 10:17" />Cu Ammon namedung de qugai eh penui Gilead deu ga ramzeuki teilu. Cine Israel namedung gwang ngkwa lwe Mizpah nam ga ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="JDG 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 10:18" />Pecai minadung nah Gilead ga hegwangnadung penui kakgade ketket dage keteudi, “Ammonme de ngngwa regi kera caune anui reugwame de teuswa laino? Pa au Gilead nam ga lungh kebamme pelane muiteube tei dizie.”<verse eid="JDG 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="JDG 11" />
  <para style="s">Jephthah Israel tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 11:1" />Gileadme pei Jephthah au reugwa kengkiengme ge, dede pa au kemmha pui ge napei. Gilead nau ne Jephthah de mnalu. <verse eid="JDG 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 11:2" />Gilead nau ne pe napeidung de de mna lu. Gilead nau napeidung ngkiengcuh luge, penui Jephthah de gwa mpet di eh pedage rangdi, “Nang au anui pei ki gade hema gumlak nang au mipui kedage na kecune.” <verse eid="JDG 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 11:3" />Cine Jephthah pe sinamedung dade pakdi nah pa Tob deuga lunghdi. Malam cikemakmedung Jephthah de twagwa eh ngngwa lungh bamla nah penui pecu nzang eh lunggwang.<verse eid="JDG 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 11:4" />Matie mene Ammon namedung Israel de ngngwa keregi. <verse eid="JDG 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 11:5" />Ammon namedung Israel de ngngwa keregi kecudau, Gilead ga hangkiamedung Tob deu gade Jephthah de qu kera miedi. <verse eid="JDG 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 11:6" />Pecai penui Jephthah dage rangdi, “Gwanglu iciude nang anui ziemne muiteube tei luzie iciu eh anui Ammon namedung de renia lu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 11:7" />Dede Jephthah au Gilead hangkiamedung dage sam keligai, “Nnui nnuikatei de acu ngkau eh meni nnui a pei ki gade acu gwa mpet di meni? Nnui daitei cu ada gwangla no nnui keherei kebam dau?” <verse eid="JDG 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 11:8" />Pecai Gilead ga hangkiamedung Jephthah dage rangdi, “Cide ziemne, anui cu nda caili nreu gwang lada; cine anuide nzang gwang nah Ammon namedung de ngngwa renia lo, iciu de nang Gilead ga lungh kebam anui pelane ziemne muibe tei luzie.” <verse eid="JDG 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 11:9" />Jephthah au Gilead hangkiamedung dage rangdi, “Magade nnui acu ngngwa cailigwang Ammon namedung de renia ziecai, nah RAMPAUBE penuide pwa a ba gage kai beu cai, Ih nnui muiteu tei kesang luzie ni?” <verse eid="JDG 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 11:10" />Pecai Gilead hangkiamedung Jephthah dage rangdi. “RAMPAUBE ne anui kakge zierangbe zie, n samde nzwa anui cinzwa teizie!” <verse eid="JDG 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 11:11" />Cine Jephthah au Gilead hangkiamedung de nzang mie di, nah minadung pecu teu penui reu kedibe nah muiteube teilu. Jephthah pe samdung pelane Mizpah gade RAMPAUBE dwade ranggai.<verse eid="JDG 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 11:12" />Pecai Jephthah samgwamedung de langpwa Ammon namedung gwangpei dage, ranggai, “Daipai tei dino anai kakga ngngwa kesia, nang adeu tangsa eh acu renia lura gwang kela ai?” <verse eid="JDG 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 11:13" />Ammonme gwangpei Jephthah samgwamedung dage sam keligai, “Kedanemene Israel au Egypt tetkah nghang keladau a deu tui teukedi, Arnon Reuki gade nghang Jabbok Reuki, nah Jordan Reuki kecangde. Cu kezuyi eh cidungde keu heli beulo.” <verse eid="JDG 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 11:14" />Pecai Jephthah au Ammon namedung gwangpei dage samgwamedung langgai dai, <verse eid="JDG 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 11:15" />nah pa pe dage rangdi, “Jephthah rangla: Israel au Moab deu mede Ammon namedung deu luma. <verse eid="JDG 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 11:16" />Ciciuliede penui Egypt deu gade nghang keladau, Israel hetaideu kahgwang Reed Jaaidi kecang delwe Kadesh ga gwanglu. <verse eid="JDG 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 11:17" />Israel samgwamedung de langpwa Edom gwangpei dage kekai dau, ranggai, ‘Kehereide peu anuide n deu kahgwang lo’ dege Edom gwangpei kiengnei tadi. Pa cinzwa Moab gwangpei dage de langgai, dede pa de peu tetkah ma. Cine Israel Kadesh ga bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 11:18" />Pecai pa hetaideu kahgwang nah Edom deu nah Moab deu gade nreu tetdi, nah pa tingnaimiak kepet deule miedi Moab deu de ziemne. Penui Arnon tu kedale ramzeuki teilu, dede penui Moab deu lungki lwetma, Arnon au Moab raiga kebamne. <verse eid="JDG 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 11:19" />Israel samgwamedung de langpwa Heshbon ga Amoritme gwangpei Sihon dage kai. Israel pedage rangdi, ‘Kehereide, peu anuide n deu gade kahpwa a bam ga gwanglo.’ <verse eid="JDG 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 11:20" />Dede Sihon au Israel pe deu ga tetkah gwang kera de penuide nlum ma. Cine Sihon pe minadung pelane de teuhekwalwe Jahaz ga penui ramzeuki teilu, delwe pa Israel de ngngwa regi. <verse eid="JDG 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 11:21" />Pecai RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, Sihon nah pe minadung pelane de Israel ba gage kai beudi nah penui cidungde de ngamlu. Iciu eh Israel ne Amoritme deu pelane cipau cuikui ga lungh kebam pelane luulu. <verse eid="JDG 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 11:22" />Penui Amoritme deugumrai ga kebam pelane gumlu, Arnon gade Jabbok kecang, nah hetaideu gade Jordan kecang. <verse eid="JDG 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 11:23" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang pe mina Israel kebam gade Amoritme de gwa mpet di delu nang cide gum kesang tei luzie ni? <verse eid="JDG 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 11:24" />Nang n rabe, Chemosh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:24 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Chemosh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ammonme mamie kereca tinggwang. </char></note>, ncu cide gumlu kera tei beucai cide gum lulak ni? Cine anui Tinggwang RAMPAUBE anui dwa gage gwa mpet gai kebeube, anui cide gum luzie. <verse eid="JDG 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 11:25" />Cu nang Balak, Zippor napei Moab gwangpei swade yiki ni? Pa Israel de ngngwa mnung lu ni, mede pa madaude penuide ngngwa hereu tei ni? <verse eid="JDG 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 11:26" />Israel mmi hai cum Heshbon nah pe renamdung, nah Aroer nah pe renamdung, nah Arnon reukung namdidung pelane ga kelung dau, daitei nang cipau tingdau gumlu dailu meno? <verse eid="JDG 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 11:27" />N dage Ih kemau teigai ma, dede nang au acu ngngwa acu hereu tei eh kemau teila. RAMPAUBE, tutiakbe, henai Israel namedung nah Ammon namedung kakga tiak zie.” <verse eid="JDG 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 11:28" />Dede Ammon namedung gwangpei Jephthah pedage samdung pa lang kegaide kiengnei ma.<verse eid="JDG 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 11:29" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Rabe Jephthah reuga gwanglu, nah pa Gilead penai Manasseh kahgwang, nah pa Gilead ga Mizpah kahgwang, nah Gilead ga Mizpah gade pa Ammon namedung da tetkah gwang. <verse eid="JDG 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 11:30" />Jephthah RAMPAUBE dage sampet lu nah rangdi “Magade nang Ammon namedung de a ba gage kai kesang beucai, <verse eid="JDG 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 11:31" />ciucai Ih Ammonme dade a lung nciep eh cailigwang keladau, a ki kikamdung gade acu redau zielie kepet keheibede, RAMPAUBE gu zie, nah Ih pecu keru ratak pelane tei beuzie.” <verse eid="JDG 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 11:32" />Cine Jephthah Ammon namedung de penuide regi kera miedi, nah RAMPAUBE penuide pwa pe ba gage kaibeu. <verse eid="JDG 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 11:33" />Ge pa penuide Aroer gade Minnith de twagwa kebam namdidung ngkai ge, nah Abel Keramin kecang gwaketang, nah daptset süt di. Cine Ammon namedung de Israel namedung ne ngamdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:32">Heb. 11:32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 11:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 11:34" />Jephthah Mizpah deukui, pe ki ga gwanglu, nah ainie, pe napui pecu redau kera tambourine kwa nah helim lim eh gwanglu. Ciciuliede pa au pumli nage; pa cide gwale pa pe na mipei mede mipui bam ma. <verse eid="JDG 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 11:35" />Pa pecu ngau luge pa pe painidung hietdi delwe pa rangdi, “Aiya, a napoi! Kesang, nang acu peu a sui sia eh keutaksu dida, nah nang au acu peu a lung tei teei kelame ma ga hangge dida! Kedanemene Ih au RAMPAUBE dage a sampet dida, nah Ih cailidi dau lakta.” <verse eid="JDG 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 11:36" />Pecai pa pedage rangdi, “A pei, nang RAMPAUBE dage n sam pet dida. Nang n sampet kelude nzwa a dage teigai lulo, RAMPAUBE n ziemne tei kebeu de nzwa: n ziemne hekum pei beuda, n ngauraumedung, Ammonme de ngam kelu gade.” <verse eid="JDG 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 11:37" />Pa pe pei dade rangdi, “A ziemne aide tei beulo. Acu kei na ge lungmpet gailo. Iciude Ih lamlwatudung rwalu kerane Ih nah a zangmedung Ih relei kemci teila di kerade ziemne haplu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 11:38" />Pa keligai, “Miecu.” Pecai pa pecu kei na ziemne langgi di. Pa nah pe zangmedung lamlwatudung ga miedi nah hapdi kedanemene pa madaude mmeu lakde kecu ziemne. <verse eid="JDG 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 11:39" />Kei na cang kedicai pa pe pei da caili gwanglu, nah pa pe ziemne sampet kelude, pa pe sampet de tei canglu. Pa relei mci ge, nah cide Israel ga renamzai di. <verse eid="JDG 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 11:40" />Mmi ramsang Israel releime Gilead mepei Jephthah napui de nsungkegai ta tei kerane lang mdaine miela.<verse eid="JDG 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="JDG 12" />
  <para style="s">Jephthah penai Ephraim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 12:1" />Ephraimme de qugai nah penui tingtünle kah hang nah Jephthah dage rangdi, “Nang daitei eh Ammonme de regi kera tetkahgwang no dede anuide peu ncu nzangmie kera qu meno? Anui mi le ncu nah n ki ru ngkau dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 12:2" />Jephthah penui dade rangdi, “Anui au mina ma kebwak süt kecu ga la dida, Ih nah a minadung nah Ammonmedung. Ih nnuide qu kegai dau, nnui acu penui ba gade keli beuma. <verse eid="JDG 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 12:3" />Nnui ngha kera gwangla kemak Ih ngau luge, Ih a teilung kerehim gage kailu, kengkieng dede nlum eh. Ih Ammonme de kahgwang, nah RAMPAUBE penuide pwa a ba gage kaibeu. Cu nnui daitei eh henai de acu regi kera gwangla no?” <verse eid="JDG 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 12:4" />Pecai Jephthah Gileadme pelane de hekwalu delwe penui Ephraimme de ngngwa regi. Gileadme au Ephraimme de regi kedanemene penui ainzwa rang kegaine, “Ephraim gade gikedime nnui, O Gileadmedung, Ephraim kakga de nah Manasseh kakga de.” <verse eid="JDG 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 12:5" />Gilead ne Ephraim deurai Jordan kahkepet nidung de tuilu. Cide teidi Ephraim ga tsaikebangme ge rang eh, “Ih kahpet lu bui mi,” dege Gileadme pedade rangla, “Nang Ephraimme ge ni?” Magade Pa “Ma lie,” rang de cai <verse eid="JDG 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 12:6" />penui pe dage rangla, “Kehereide Shibboleth: de ranglu,” dede pa “Sibboleth” de eh rang cai, pa rang petau teilu kemakne, penui pecu tuilu delwe Jordan kahkepetnidung gade pecu daptset dila. Cidau Ephraimme cang riakdaiekena de teitsetdi.<verse eid="JDG 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 12:7" />Jephthah mmi herok Israel tutiak tei. Pecai Gileadme pei Jephthah tsaidi nah penui pecu Gilead ga namdi ge gage kungdi.<verse eid="JDG 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ibzan, Elon, nah Abdon tutiakme teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 12:8" />Pecai Jepthah tsai kedicai Bethlehemme pei Ibzan ne Israel tutiak tei. <verse eid="JDG 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 12:9" />Pa pena mipeina camrei nah mipuina camrei bamla. Pa pe napui camrei de peu pe pautsa gwale ge mmeu gaidi, nah pa pe pautsa gwale de releime camrei de pe napeidung nau kerane ngngwa gwanglu. Pa mmi hena Israel tutiak tei. <verse eid="JDG 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 12:10" />Pecai Ibzan tsaidi nah penui pecu Bethlehem gage kungdi. <verse eid="JDG 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 12:11" />Pecai Elon Zebulunme ge Israel tutiak tei. Pa mmi kerei Israel tutiak. <verse eid="JDG 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 12:12" />Pecai Elon Zebulunme pei tsaidi nah penui pecu Zebulunme deu Aijalon nam gage kungdi.<verse eid="JDG 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 12:13" />Pecai, Abdon, Pirathonme me Hillel napei Israel tutiak. <verse eid="JDG 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 12:14" />Pa pe napei riakdai bam nah pe tsame camrei bam, penui gadaseudung riakhena reu cwala. Pa mmi heset Israel tutiak. <verse eid="JDG 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 12:15" />Pecai Abdon, Pirathonme Hillel napei tsaidi nah pecu Ephraim deu ga Pirathon namdi gage kungdi, Amalekme deudi tu nam gage.<verse eid="JDG 12:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="JDG 13" />
  <para style="s">Samson de mnakelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 13:1" />Israel namedung kemauta aidungde RAMPAUBE dwa gade tei jüja ladi, cine RAMPAUBE penuide mmi riakdai ge Philistinme ba gage kai beudi.<verse eid="JDG 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 13:2" />Cika Zorah renam gade kegwang mipei ge la, Dan leuh gade, nah pe zi Manoah. Pe nau au hena gah nah pa madaude mna ma. <verse eid="JDG 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 13:3" />RAMPAUBE gwabe pe naude peu pecu ngaugai delwe pa pe dage rangdi, “Ainie, kehereide, nang hena gah nah nang hena mna ma, dede nang au tetlak luzie delwe nang mipeina ge mna luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:31">Luk. 1:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 13:4" />Ciziemne nang zau mede kengkiengbe zau sak kelak sünne lulo, nah nang mci kemak keheibe de tyei so.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:15">Luk. 1:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 13:5" />Kedanemene nang tetlak luzie da nah mipeina ge mna luzie. Tangkane gede pe peu reu gage kailak, kedanemene neki be gade Nazarite<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nazarite: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrewme led gade Nazarite pekie au mige RAMPAUBE dage kemlang sampet tei kelume gede rangla, Pum. 6:1-21 ga rangla kecu nzwa.</char></note> ge eh Tinggwang ziemne keuntsam kelu ge dizie lu. Pa Israelme de Philistinme ba gade kelibeu zie.” <verse eid="JDG 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 13:6" />Pecai mipuide nlütlwe nah pa pe nahpei dage rangmci liagai, “Tinggwang mina be ada gwang lie. Ih pecu hing sütdi kedanemene pa Tinggwang samgwabe rehi nzwa kecune, cine pa daiga de gwangbi Ih pecu keteu ma. Pa pe zi a dage ranglia ma. <verse eid="JDG 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 13:7" />Pecai pa ada de rangdi, ‘Nang tetlak lu zie nah nang mipeina ge de mna luzie. Cine cu au nang zau mede kengkieng zau sak so, nah nang mcikemak mage de tyei so, kedanemene hena nabe neki gade gwang ketsai tingba kecang Tinggwang gu Naziritme ge zielu.’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 2:23">Mat. 2:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 13:8" />Pecai Manoah RAMPAUBE dage kekie teigai nah pa rangdi, “Oh kehereide, a RAMPAUBO, kehereide nang langkegai Tinggwang minabe de peu anai da gwang dailo iciude lungh gwang lai kebam nade ziemne anai daipai teilu maisiabi pa ranglia lu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 13:9" />Tinggwang au Manoah kwa kingnei lu, nah Tinggwang samgwabe mipui cide luh ga ntum kebam dau pe da gwangdai. Dede pe nahpei Manoah au pecu ngngwa bam ma. <verse eid="JDG 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 13:10" />Cine mipui be kelwa pakgwang eh pe nahpei de pau beu, nah pa pe dade rangdi, “Pielo! Cipaunai ada kegwangbe de pecu peu ngaudai gaida!” <verse eid="JDG 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 13:11" />Cine Manoah cuhlwe pa pe nau caisui miedi. Pa minabe da gwang luge pa pe dage keteudi, “Aipau pui dage marang kegaibe de nang deni?” Pa keligai, “Ih da.” <verse eid="JDG 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 13:12" />Pecai Manoah ranggai, “N samdung de gwang canglu de. Mipeina daipai tei maisia no, nah pe bata daipai zie no?” <verse eid="JDG 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 13:13" />RAMPAUBE samgwabe Manoah sam keligai, “Kedanemene mipui be dage Ih rang kebeu pelane ziemne, pa pekatei pecu teu sünne lu maisia. <verse eid="JDG 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 13:14" />Zau teilu kela kubetsi gade kegwang keheibe de, pa tyei kerabe ma. Pa zau mede zau kengkiengbe sak lak, nah mcikemak keheibe de tyeilak. Ih pedage rang kebeu leune, pa teilu maisia.”<verse eid="JDG 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 13:15" />Pecai Manoah au RAMPAUBE samgwabe dage ranggai, “Anai ncu peu bam kecu teineu bamlie, anai hemeuna ge de peu ncu tyei kera langbeulu kemaktane.” <verse eid="JDG 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 13:16" />RAMPAUBE samgwabe Manoah sam keligai, “Nnai acu peu bamsi liede, Ih nnai tangku tyeilak. Dede nnai RAMPAUBE ziemne keru ratak mtei neucai, nnai cide peugai lubui.” Manoah pa RAMPAUBE samgwabe lie kecu ci kemakne. <verse eid="JDG 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 13:17" />Pecai Manoah RAMPAUBE samgwabe dage ranggai, “N zi cauno, n samdung teicang gwangde anai ncu rütlu kerane?” <verse eid="JDG 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 13:18" />RAMPAUBE samgwabe pe sam keligai “Nang daitei, a zi keteu au no, dede cide au cicanglulak!” <verse eid="JDG 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 13:19" />Manoah hemeu hau gade hemeuna de nah reca de pwalu delwe RAMPAUBE de reca bam reu gage ratak de pwabeu lu. Cidau pa au miswakegah bata ge teigai lai kebamdau Manoah penai penau au pie bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 13:20" />Recabam gade miheu le tinggimdung lamge cu kegaidau, Manoah penai pe nau pie kebam gade RAMPAUBE samgwabe recabam miheu gade cuhdi. Cine penai keumie eh reca bamdi.<verse eid="JDG 13:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 13:21" />Dede RAMPAUBE samgwabe au Manoah mede pe nau dage pecu liasi tadi. Ge Manoah pa RAMPAUBE samgwabe lie kecu cilu. <verse eid="JDG 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 13:22" />Manoah pe nau dage ranggai, “Anai tsai bizie da kedanemene anai Tinggwang de ngaudi delu!” <verse eid="JDG 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 13:23" />Dede pe nau pe sam keligai “RAMPAUBE anai de teitset neu cai, pa anai ba gade keru reca de nah reca peu kegaide luu lak. Pa a naide ma aidung pelane pwalia lak, nah aipau ting ga pa anaide peu aipau hade siu lak nage.” <verse eid="JDG 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 13:24" />Mipui be mipei nage mna lu, nah pa pe zi Samson msiaklu. Hena nabe ngkieng cuhlu nah RAMPAUBE pecu samlam beu. <verse eid="JDG 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 13:25" />Cu RAMPAUBE Rabe ne Mahaneh Dan, Zorah penai Eshtaol nam kakga kebam ni gade pecu teingkieng beu cuhdi.<verse eid="JDG 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="JDG 14" />
  <para style="s">Samson laktak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 14:1" />Samson Timnah ga nghung, nah pa Timnah nam gade relei gede ngaulu, Philistinme napuidung kakgade. <verse eid="JDG 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 14:2" />Pecai pa caili nghang dai eh pe pei penai pe pui dage paubeu eh pa ranggai, “Ih relei gede Timnah gade ngaulie, Philistinme napuidung kakgade. Cine Ih pecu anau kera rengei beulo.” <verse eid="JDG 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 14:3" />Pe pei penai pe pui pe sam keligai, “Anui kibaume kakga relei nage de gah ni, mede a minadung pelane kakga, iciu eh nang hegeurum kemak Philistinme dade henau ge lu launi?” Samson pe pei dage ranggai, “A ziemne pecu ngngwa gwang beulo, kedanemene pa au a dwade petau lu.” <verse eid="JDG 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 14:4" />Dede pe pei penai pe pui au makie aide RAMPAUBE dade kegwang ci bam ma, kedanemene pa au Philistinme de renia gai kera peting keyi ge pei bam kecune. Cidau tingdau Philistinme Israel reu kedi tei kebamne.<verse eid="JDG 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 14:5" />Pecai Samson pe pei penai pe pui de nzang Timnah kubeluh kemdei ga mie, nah ainie, hingho nage mrah eh pe taiga gwanglu. <verse eid="JDG 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 14:6" />RAMPAUBE Rabe pecu tei ngkieng süt beu, nah pa cide hemeuna gede teurak kecu nzwa teurak kecaidi, pe ba ga magade gah dede pa pe pei mede pe pui dage pa tei kedide ranglia ma. <verse eid="JDG 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 14:7" />Pecai pa tet nghung releipui dage marang, nah Samson pecu pesui di.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:33">Heb. 11:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 14:8" />Pecai pa matie mene pecu ngngwalu kera cailigwang. Pa hingho pau de piegai kera lampui de pütdi eh tet pet, ge ainie, cika hingho ketsai paau de ga tegeine maage bwabam nah heliadui bam. <verse eid="JDG 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 14:9" />Pa cide pe badeu kena le keulwe tetmie, tyei jüja pe pei penai pe pui da mie. Pa penaide kesa de peugai cine penai de tyeilu, dede pa penai de pa hingho pau gade heliadui kuimpet lu dilie kecu ranglia ma.<verse eid="JDG 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 14:10" />Pecai pe pei releipui lungh kebam de ga miedi, nah cika Samson kesak ngyi ge telei gai, kedanemene rehangmedung cinzwa teigai kelane. <verse eid="JDG 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 14:11" />Ge penui pecu ngau luge, penui kangngwa nnatume rehangme mina camrei ge de ngngwa gwanglwe penui pecu ngngwa bam kera. <verse eid="JDG 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 14:12" />Samson penui dage ranggai, “Acu maregwa ge nnui dage peu rang gailo. Magade nnui cide kesak ngyi lang henane ting gage acu rangmci lia kesang lucai, nah nnui peei siakte lucai Ih nnuide langcimpaidung cwareu camrei nah paikereleu camrei peu zie. <verse eid="JDG 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 14:13" />Dede nnui a dage rangmci kegai teiluta dicai, nnui acu langcimpaidung cwareu camrei nah paidung kereleu camrei peu zie nnuikatei.” Penui pedage ranggai, “N regwa de ranggai cu, anui cide siulu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 14:14" />Pa penui dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">“Ketyeikau dade taktyei lwapet;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:14">nah kengkieng ge dade kekum lwapet.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:14">Dede penui langcum ne gade maregwa de rangmci lu tadi.<verse eid="JDG 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 14:15" />Pecai lang henane benai penui Samson nau dage rangdi, “N nahpei de kemeu gailo ciude pa anuide maregwa de rangai beuzie, mecai anui mi teu eh ncu nah n pei kelak de ru dizie. Nang anuide gwa di kerane qu gai ni?” <verse eid="JDG 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 14:16" />Pecai Samson nau petai gade hap eh pa rangdi “Nang au acu ngkau kesang! Nang acu hung ma! Nang maregwa ge a ramme peidung dage ranggai, dede nang acu ranglia ma.” Pa pedage ranggai, “Ainie, Ih a pei mede a pui dage de ranglia ma, Ih ncu ranglia kerabe ni?” <verse eid="JDG 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 14:17" />Pa pe taigade penui kesak ngyi lang henane tingde hap jüja bamdi. Ge lang henane benai pa pedage ranglia gai kedanemene pa pecu ranglia lo keteu ketang eh bam kedine, iciuge pa pe rehangmedung dage maregwa cide pa ranglia beu. <verse eid="JDG 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 14:18" />Ge namdibe ga mipeidung lang henane benai tingnaimiak nlüt kemak dwa pe dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Daipai heliadui swa kumki no?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">Nah daipai hingho swa ngkieng no?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="JDG 14:18">Cine pa penui dage ranggai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">“Nnui a tumlei le puh maige,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nnui anau dade keuteu maige</char></note></para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 14:18">nnui a regwa de pei mpet gailak nage.”<verse eid="JDG 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 14:19" />Pecai RAMPAUBE Rabe pecu tei ngkieng süt beu. Pa Ashkelon nam ga nghung lu delwe penui mina camrei de gidi. Pa mi ma tuilu delwe pa maregwa gade pai kereleudung de peudi. Pa pe rata sütdi, nah pa pe pei ki ga nghangdi. <verse eid="JDG 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 14:20" />Pecai Samson nau de pe pei ne Samson de ngngwa kelabe, pe zangna yitube de nau peudi.<verse eid="JDG 14:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="JDG 15" />
  <para style="s">Samson Philistinme dade hekumkepei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 15:1" />Pecai, wheat luhlüt tingdau, Samson hemeu hau gade hemeu nage teu eh pe nau da mie. Kedanemene pa rang eh, “Ih a nau da mie zie, helungbe bung ga.” Dede pe pei pecu peu lwetma. <verse eid="JDG 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 15:2" />Pe pei rangdi, “Kesang nang pecu ngkau bi kela Ih rang gaila, cine Ih pecu nzangbe de penau kera peu dida. Pe caihereibe pui au peswa yi meni? Kehereide pe keleu gade pecu n nau lulo.” <verse eid="JDG 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 15:3" />Samson penui dage rangdi, “Henaipia Philistinme hade gade Ih penuide renia eh kekap teu kegwang ga Ih a mau gah.” <verse eid="JDG 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 15:4" />Pecai Samson mie maiserungdung hai cum tuilu delwe pa pemi kenana kang ncütlu. Pa helei ket mtaulwe pemi kena kak sum gage kailu. <verse eid="JDG 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 15:5" />Pa heleidung de mi taugai, delwe cidungde de Philistinme meibang kesapdung kak gage hiak gaidi. Cine pa meibangdung nah sap kebam meidung kenana rudi, kubeluh de, nah olive gurie de si eh. <verse eid="JDG 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 15:6" />Cine Philistinme rangdi, “Caune aide teino?” Ge penui keligai, “Samson, pe pau Timnahme pei, pa pe nau de pwa pe zangna be de peu kedine.” Cine Philistinme hang pe napui nah pe pei de mi le rudi. <verse eid="JDG 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 15:7" />Samson penui dage rangdi, “Nnui ainzwa tei kesang kedine, Ih nnuide renia eh a kumpeei di delei, nah pecai au, Ih mtak dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 15:8" />Pa penui pipei nah mniedung gage kedeu, daptset sütdi. Pecai pa nghung heni Etam tsu qukela tsuraki ga bamdi.<verse eid="JDG 15:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 15:9" />Dede Philistinme hanglu delwe Judah ga ramzeuki teilu nah penui Lehi nam ga hereu tei kera mteilu. <verse eid="JDG 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 15:10" />Cu Judah ga minadung rangdi, “Daitei eh nnui anuide renia hang lano?” Penui rangdi, “Anui au Samson de kanglu kera hangla, pa anui dage tei kegai kesiakke pecu teibeu kera.” <verse eid="JDG 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 15:11" />Pecai Judah ga mipei cangcum Etam tsupop ga nghung lu delwe penui Samson dage rangdi, “Nang ci meni Philistinme anui reu di kebam? Aide daipai nang anui dage teigai dino?” Pa penui dage keligai, “Penui a dage tei kegai kesiakke, Ih de penui dage teigai dida.” <verse eid="JDG 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 15:12" />Penui pe sam keligai, “Anui ncu kanglu kera nghung luda ncu pwa Philistinme ba gage kai beudi kerane.” Dede Samson penui dage rangdi, “Nnui ne acu teilak lie kecu sampet lulo.” <verse eid="JDG 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 15:13" />Penui pe sam keligai eh, “Lak, dede anui ncu kang bi luzie delwe anui ncu pwa penui ba gage kaibeu dizie. Dede kesang anui ncu teitset dilak.” Delwe penui pecu heria keheci kenale kanglu delwe pecu tsupop gade pwa nghanglu.<verse eid="JDG 15:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 15:14" />Pa Lehi deige ga gwanglu, ge Philistinme pecu mna gwang ge penui masah di. Ge RAMPAUBE Rabe pecu tei ngkieng süt beu. Heriadung pe ba ga kangpwa kelade penui mi ne ru kedi reigau tie nzwadi, cine periade pe ba gade hiak mpet di. <verse eid="JDG 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 15:15" />Pa gada geijara keheci ge ngaulu, nah pa pe ba hetwa pet cide keulu nah pa cide pwa mipei pecang gede daptset di. <verse eid="JDG 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 15:16" />Pecai Samson rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">“Gada geijara le, ketsai paau keheswa reu, gage heswalu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="JDG 15:16">gada geijara le Ih mipei pecang gede teitsetlu.”<verse eid="JDG 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 15:17" />Pa marang cang dige pa geijara de pe ba gade kelien gidi, nah pa heni cide zi Ramath Lehi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide pekie Geijara Deutu</char></note> msiaklu. <verse eid="JDG 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 15:18" />Pecai Samson hereu sütdi nah RAMPAUBE dage sahgai eh pa rangdi, “Nang nkatei ne ngkiengkelu kedi aide N kilabe ba gage kai beuda. Dede cu Ih hereu eh tsai dizie deni iciu eh hegeurum kemakme ba ga Ih lütti kera.” <verse eid="JDG 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 15:19" />Cine Tinggwang Lehi ga kebam ketietki ge let gaibeu, nah cikade dui lwampetlu. Pa sak luge pe kengkieng gwang dailu ciu eh pa ncang gwang dailu. Ciziemne pa heni cide zi En Hakkore<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">cide pekie kie kegaibe duilet</char></note> msiaklu, cide henai kecang de Lehi ga bam. <verse eid="JDG 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 15:20" />Ciciu eh Philistinme kedi ketei tingdau Samson mmi ngkai Israelme tutiak teigwang.<verse eid="JDG 15:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="JDG 16" />
  <para style="s">Samson nah Delilah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 16:1" />Pecai Samson Gaza nam ga miege, pa cika helipui gede ngaulu, nah pa pecu ngngwa zeu ga gwang. <verse eid="JDG 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 16:2" />Ge Gazamedung rangdi, “Samson aika gwang luda.” Cine penui pecu twagwalu delwe penui namdi be rieki ga bam eh tingmuiziu pelane pecu kwa bamdi. Penui katei tingmuiziu pelane matu mezing eh bam, rang eh, “Tingcang baapet de, cidau anui pecu teitset dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 16:3" />Samson au tingmui muisum kecang zeu. Pecai muisum dau pa cuhlu nah pa namdibe kirie kikamdung zütlu nah kikamtsia kena de si eh. Pa cidungde pecap de si eh züt mpetlu, pa cidung pe hekeutu gage pwalu, nah pa Hebron namdi dwaga kebam kideutu twang ga cidung pwa nghanglu.<verse eid="JDG 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 16:4" />Cipau cai pa Sorek langkam ga mipui gede mrai di. Pe zi au Delilah. <verse eid="JDG 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 16:5" />Philistinme deuceudidung peda gwang eh penui pe dage rangdi, “Pecu peu ranggai lo. Daipai ne pecu tei ngkieng süt bambi kecu nah dainzwa anui pe reu ngkieng lubui bi pie gailo, iciu eh anui pecu kanglwe pecu tei mneilu kerane. Iciude anui hangge ge kecu rangkanggeu cange hai ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu cange hai ge: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">12.5 kilogram.</char></note> ramcau ncu peuzie.” <verse eid="JDG 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 16:6" />Cine Delilah au Samson dage rangdi, “Kehereide, daipai ne ncu tei ngkieng süt bambi, nah ncu tei mneilu kerane dainzwa ncu kanglu buibi a dage ranglia lo?” <verse eid="JDG 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 16:7" />Samson pe sam keligai, “Magade penui heria keheci hena canghdi kemakbe teu acu kanglu cai, cidau Ih mnei dizie, nah Ih mina kedame ge nzwa dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 16:8" />Pecai Philistinme deuceudidung canghdi kemak keheci heria hena peda teugwang beu, nah cidung teu pa pecu kanglu. <verse eid="JDG 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 16:9" />Nah pa tuilu kera maade kibung gage kaizeu delwe pa pe dage ranggai, “Philistinme aika ncu tui kera gwang lada, Samson!” Dede pa heriadung de teicakdi heleilakpi ria ge mi gage kekaidau cakdi kela nzwa. Cine pe kengkieng cide cilu tadi.<verse eid="JDG 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 16:10" />Pecai Delilah Samson dage rangdi, “Ainie, nang acu cwa dida nah nang a dade kenret rang dida. Cu a dage rang gailo, kehereide, dainzwa eh ncu kanglu buino.” <verse eid="JDG 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 16:11" />Pa pedage rangdi, “Magade penui heria keheci madaude teu heta tei kemakdung penui pwa acu kang cai, Ih mnei dizie nah Ih kedame minadung nzwakap dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 16:12" />Cine Delilah heria kehecidung keulu delwe cidung teu pecu kanglu. Pa pedage ranggai, “Philistinme nda gwang lada, Samson!” Tuilu kera maa kilung ga bam eh. Dede pa helangria nzwa cidungde pe ba gade teicak gidi.<verse eid="JDG 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 16:13" />Pecai Delilah samson dage rangdi, “Cu kecang nang acu cwa nah ada kenret rang dida. A dage ranglia lo dainzwa eh ncu kang lubui bi.” Cine pa pedage rangdi, “Magade nang a peutam riadung hena de pwa ncüt lucai nah cide peutwa gele kanglu lie cai.” <verse eid="JDG 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 16:14" />Pa cidungde dei gage kang kecütlu, delwe pa pe dage rangdi, “Philistinme ncu tui kera aika gwangla da, Samson!” Dede pa zip kebam gade cuhlu delwe pa pwa kenzeude gade nah peutwa de gade tsing tie de zütdi.<verse eid="JDG 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 16:15" />Ge pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang dainzwa ‘Ih ncu hunglie’ de rang lulai, n mlung au ada la meni? Nang pia cum acu cwa dida nah nang daipai nzwa ngkieng lubi acu ranglia meda.” <verse eid="JDG 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 16:16" />Cipau nai tingbazie pelane pa pecu marang ketang eh bamdi. Pa pecu ketang jüja bamdi cine pe lung teimsia süt bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 16:17" />Cine pa pe mlung ga kebam pelane pecu rangbeu di delwe pa pe dage rangdi, “Tangkane gede a peu gage kaima, kedanemene Ih au a pui neki gade Tinggwang ziemne Naziritme ge teila di delu. Magade Ih a tam tai mcigi dicai, ciucai a kengkieng a dade gah dizie, nah Ih mnei dizie nah Ih kedame minadung nzwa dizie.”<verse eid="JDG 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 16:18" />Delilah au pe mlung ga kebam pelane pe dage rang kebeu cilu ge, pa mide langgai eh Philistinme deuceudidung de qulu eh ranggai, “Piage hang dailu, pa a dage pe mlung ga kebam pelane rangbeu di delu.” Pecai Philistinme kedimedung peda hanglu, nah penui rangkanggeu penui ba ga pwalwe gwanglu. <verse eid="JDG 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 16:19" />Pecai pa pecu pe mnie reu gage teinzip di nah pa minabe de qulu cidau pa pe peu gade tam ria hena de tai mpet di. Cinzwa pa pecu teimnei cuhdi, nah pe kengkieng pedade tetdi. <verse eid="JDG 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 16:20" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Philistinme ncu tui kera aika gwangla da Samson!” Pa zip kebam gade mrak lwe pa rangdi, “Ih pedwa paklu kela nzwa pak luzie nah Ih akatei de ngheu mpet luzie.” Dede pa au RAMPAUBE pe dade tetkedi ci ma. <verse eid="JDG 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 16:21" />Philistinme pecu tuilu delwe penui pe miak kena de let mpetdi. Penui pecu Gaza ga teu nghunglu delwe penui pecu hegeu ria kenale kanglu. Cidau pa hebaangme ki ga maniak bam. <verse eid="JDG 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 16:22" />Ciuliede, pe peu ga pe tam tai kedide lungpet cuh daidi.<verse eid="JDG 16:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samson tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 16:23" />Philistinme gu deuceudidung penui Dagon tinggwang dage reca disüt ge teigai beu kera penuikatei gwang ngkwalu, nah suiyi mneilu kerane. Penui rangdi, “Anui tinggwang au Samson de anui ba gage kaipwa peuda, anui ngaurau kedibe de.” <verse eid="JDG 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 16:24" />Minadung pecu ngau luge, penui gu tinggwang de twadi, kedanemene penui rangdi, “Anui rabe anui ngauraube de pwa anui ba gage kai beuda, anui deu kengkapbe de, anui minadung kekiee de teitset kedibe de.” <verse eid="JDG 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 16:25" />Penui mlung sui kebamdau, penui rangdi, “Samson de qu gailo pecu peu anuide tei renga gai kera.” Cine penui hebaangme ki gade Samson de qulu nah pa penui dwa gade penuide tei renga gai beu. Penui pecu peu hetsia kena kakga saplu. <verse eid="JDG 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 16:26" />Samson pe ba teu kebambe rehangbe dage rangdi, “Acu peu mtak gailo! Acu peu hetsia kenade tung gailo, ki cidungde rapwa kebam kenade, iciu eh Ih ci kena reuga akatei ngngei lu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 16:27" />Cidau cide ga mipeidung nah mipuidung puibam, nah cika Philistinme deuceudidung pelane bam. Kireu ga mipei mipui cang cum kenzwa ge bam, Samson penuide tei renga kecu piebam.<verse eid="JDG 16:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 16:28" />Pecai Samson RAMPAUBE de qugai nah pa kiedi, “A RAMPAUBO, acu nsung gailo, kehereide! Kehereide acu teingkieng gailo, cu piage, O Tinggwang, iciude Ih akatei Philistinme dade a miak kenade ziemne hekum pei eh hekum kepei ta tei luzie.” <verse eid="JDG 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 16:29" />Samson ki cide rapwa kebam sumbe tsia kenade tuipwa lu. Pa ci kenade ga ngngei lu, ket pe zetle ba, nah kedabe pe hile. <verse eid="JDG 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 16:30" />Pecai Samson rangdi, “A keringria au Philistinme de ngngwa tsai zieda.” Pa pe kengkieng teu eh nzangpet gai ge ki cide cika kebam deuceudidung nah kilung ga kebam mina pelane reuga cakmie. Cine pa pe tsit dau mina teitset kelu au pa ring keladau swade teitset kieelu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:32">Heb. 11:32</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 16:31" />Pecai pe sinamedung nah pe pei kelak pelane pe paau pwalu kerane hung. Penui pecu pwalu, delwe caili nghang. Penui pecu Zorah penai Eshtaol kakga, pe pei Manoah de kekung bam gage kungdi. Samson Israel de mmi ngkai tutiak tei.<verse eid="JDG 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="JDG 17" />
  <para style="s">Micah gu mamie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 17:1" />Ephraim hangdeutu deudi ga mipei ge bamla, nah pezi cai Micah. <verse eid="JDG 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 17:2" />Pa pe pui dage rangdi, “Rangkanggeu cang ge hai ge ndade mige rega teu kedide, nang cide gage reset sampet kebeude, nah cipau reude nang a kwen gage rang kegaide, ainie! Rangkanggeu de a da la. Ih ne akatei cide keu ludi.” Pe pui rangdi, “Ana de RAMPAUBE ne samlam beuda!” <verse eid="JDG 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 17:3" />Pecai pa rangkanggeu cang ge haige de pe pui de keu caili beudi ge pe pui rangdi, “Ih rangkanggeu de RAMPAUBE dage teimci cangsiak gaibeu dida, a ba gade a na ba gage mamie ge teilu nah kemai kelu mie ge teilu kerane. Cine cu, Ih ncu keu caili beu dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 17:4" />Iciuliede pa pe pui dage rangkanggeu de peu caili beudi, pe pui rangkanggeu hai na keulu delwe pa cide pwa hegeu ta tei kecime de peudi. Pa cide pwa mamie teilu, nah kemai kelu mie ge, nah cine cide Micah kiga bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 17:5" />Cu Micah cipaude pa rabedung ki ge bamla. Pa hekeutupai ge nah kelak mamiedung teilu, nah pa pe napei hangge de cingku kedetlu. <verse eid="JDG 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 17:6" />Cipau tingdau Israel ga hegwangpei ge de gah. Mi hangge ge kecu pedwa gade petaube keheibe de teila.<verse eid="JDG 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 17:7" />Cu Judah ga Bethlehem namdi gade rehangme ge bamla, Judah kelak gade, nah pa au Levime ge. Pa cika gwang lunghbam la. <verse eid="JDG 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 17:8" />Mipei de namdi gade tetdi, Judah ga Bethlehem gade pa ngau kelu heni kehei gade lungh kerane. Pa mbeuh gwang keladau Ephraim hangdeutu deudi ga Micah kiga gwanglu. <verse eid="JDG 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 17:9" />Micah pe dage keteudi, “Nang dai gade gwangla no?” Pa pe dage keligai, “Ih au Levime ge Judah ga Bethlehem gade gwanglie, nah Ih au heni ngaulu kebui kehei gade Ih lungh kera mie lalie.” <verse eid="JDG 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 17:10" />Micah pe dage rangdi, “A da bamlu, delwe acu keledeube nah cingkupei lulo. Ih ncu mmi ge rangkanggeu kerei nah paihenidung nah nang teu maikesiabe peu zie.” Cine Levime pei de pa kerang de luulu delwe pe ki ga nlütdi. <verse eid="JDG 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 17:11" />Cine Levime pei de cipaude de ngngwa bam neudi, nah rehangbe de pe napeime ge nzwa tei eh bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 17:12" />Micah Levime pei de pe cingku kedetlu nah rehangbe de Micah kiga lunghdi. <verse eid="JDG 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 17:13" />Pecai Micah rangdi, “Cu au RAMPAUBE a ziemne ngkiengkelu peu zie Ih cibam, Ih au Levime pei aide teu a cingkupei ge tei kelune.”<verse eid="JDG 17:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="JDG 18" />
  <para style="s">Dan leuhme Laish ga kelung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 18:1" />Cidau tingdau Israel ga hegwangpei ge de gah. Cidau Dan leuhme penui lungh kerane hangdeu ge peeila, kedanemene penui Israelme leuh kakga de hangdeu gum kera gede ngaulu mereu kecune. <verse eid="JDG 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 18:2" />Dan namedung penui kelak gade mina hangmengei de langgai, penui kakgade mipeidung, mina kekuume, Zorah nah Eshtaol nam gade, hepi le hangdeu pei tetkera, nah cide pei sünnelu kerane. Penui penui dade rangdi, “Miecu! Hangdeu de pie sünnelu.” Penui hangdeutu deudi Ephraim ga gwanglu, kemdei Micah ki kecang ga, nah penui cipau ziude cika bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 18:3" />Penui Micah ki ga kebam dau, penui Levime rehangpei kwa cilu. Cine penui cika nreupet delwe penui pe dage rangdi, “Caune ncu aika ngngwa gwang no? Nang heni aika daipai teibam no? Nang aika daitei bamno?” <verse eid="JDG 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 18:4" />Pa penui dage keligai, “Ainzwa eh Micah a ziemne teigai, pa a zie luilu nah Ih au pe cingkupei lie.” <verse eid="JDG 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 18:5" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “keteulo, kehereide, Tinggwang dade, iciude anui ci luzie anui beuh ngkienglu kera, anui cu mbeuhmie kelade.” <verse eid="JDG 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 18:6" />Cingkupei penui dage rangdi, “Helung nciep eh miecu, nnui mie kela beuh de ga RAMPAUBE nnui dwaga lalie.”<verse eid="JDG 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 18:7" />Pecai penui hang mengei baude tetdi delwe penui Laish nam ga gwanglu. Penui cika kelunghme kakga kwak eh Sidonmedung nzwa, nciep nah kwak eh lungh kebam ngaulu. Hangdeu cika migede penuide hengam teibeu kecu bam ma. Ketiplwe, penui au Sidonmedung dade mdei di nah cika penui mikedadung de ngngwa kencüt kecu gah. <verse eid="JDG 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 18:8" />Pecai penui Zorah penai Eshtaol ga penui sinamedung da miedi. Penui sinamedung penui da rangdi, “Nnui dai ngaulu dino?” <verse eid="JDG 18:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 18:9" />Penui sam keligai, “Cuh zette lu, anui mie penuide renia lu kerane! Kedanemene anui hangdeu de ngauda nah ainie, cide au yisüt lie. Dede nnui au mlai ma. Nnui hangdeu de gumlu kera lüt kera lunghau eh bam kerabe ma. <verse eid="JDG 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 18:10" />Nnui kemie dau, nnui minadung lungh ntiprip kebamme da gwangzie, nah hangdeu cide lule ailam gade nzasüt! Kedanemene Tinggwang kideu ga magede gah kecu heni ge nnui ba gage kaibeu dida.”<verse eid="JDG 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 18:11" />Cine penui cikade hebeuh teitet di, mipei hai herok Dan leuhme kelak gade, Zorah penai Eshtaol gade mpet lu, hereuketei reunetdung teu lu eh. <verse eid="JDG 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 18:12" />Penui tet hanglwe Judah deu ga Kiriath Jearim gage ramzeuki teilu. Heni cide de Mahaneh Dan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:12 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mahaneh Dan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pekie Dan gu ramzeuki.</char></note> lie henai kecang qula. Cide Kiriath Jearim naimiak kenlütle ga bamla. <verse eid="JDG 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 18:13" />Penui cikade hangdeutu deudi Ephraim ga kahgwang di, nah penui Micah ki ga nghanglu.<verse eid="JDG 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 18:14" />Pecai mina nghang mengei bau penui pile Laish ga hangdeu peeipet eh mie kedime penui sinamedung sam keli eh ranggai, “Nnui ki aidung ga hekeutupai ge, kelak mamiedung, mamie heri kelu ge, nah mamie kemai kelu ge bam kecu ci meni? Cine cu, cet gailo nnui daipai teizie bi?” <verse eid="JDG 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 18:15" />Cine penui cika nreu lüt nah penui rehangpei Levime pei, Micah ki ga gwanglu, nah penui pa yibam ha keteu gai. <verse eid="JDG 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 18:16" />Cu mipei hai herok Dan namedung dade lunghgwang kelu, penui reunetdung kai kelume, herieki kimui ga bamlu. <verse eid="JDG 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 18:17" />Kideu hepile peipet eh mie kedime hang mengei bau cuhlu, penui cika gwanglu. Penui herikelu miede keulu, hekeutupai de, kelak mamiedung, nah kemaikelu miede, nah cidau cingkupei au hereu ziemne mina hai herok hereunetdung kai kelume de ngngwa eh herieki kimui ga sapbam. <verse eid="JDG 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 18:18" />Aidungde Micah ki ga lüt luge, nah penui mamie herikelude keulu, hekeutupai de, kelak mamiedung de, nah kemai kelu miede keu luge, cingkupei penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daipai tei lano?” <verse eid="JDG 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 18:19" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Matu so! N ba pwa n mui kebalu delwe anuide nzanggwang lulo, nah anui ziemne mipei ge nah cingkupei ge lulo. Nang mige ki kelak cingkupei keteibe nziemne cide yiki mi mede nang heleuh cingkupei nah Israel ga kelak ge cingkupei be n ziemne yiki no?” <verse eid="JDG 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 18:20" />Cingkupei pe suiyi sütlu, cine pa hekeutupai, kelak mamiedung, nah mamie herikelu de keulu, delwe pa minadung kakga miedi.<verse eid="JDG 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 18:21" />Pecai penui nreulu delwe penui tetdi. Penui hena keceunadung, kauruine, nah mania keyibe penui dwage kailu. <verse eid="JDG 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 18:22" />Penui Micah ki gade mdei süt kecu ga miedi, cidau Micah ki taiga mina ki ga kebammedung de qu hekwalu, delwe penui Dan namedung dwa railu. <verse eid="JDG 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 18:23" />Penui Dan namedung de qulu. Penui zudung nreu gwang eh penui Micah dage rangdi, “Ncu daipai teidi eh nnui gwang ngkwa bam no?” <verse eid="JDG 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 18:24" />Pa keligai, “Ih a rabedung tei kelude nang keu luda, nah cingkupei, nah nang tet dida. Ih daipai bamsi reuno? Ciciu cai nang dainzwa nah acu ainzwa keteulu buino, ‘Ncu daipai teidi deno?’”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 31:30">Ken. 31:30</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 18:25" />Dan namedung pe sam keligai, “Nang anui kakga ge n kwa peu siu kerabe ma, mecai rata kesiamedung gwang ncu ngngwa renia dizie lu, iciude nang n teilung nah n kibaume teilung cide le kengkap nang rum zielu.” <verse eid="JDG 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 18:26" />Cine Dan namedung penui lampuile miedi kedanemene penui au peswa ngkiengki lie kecu Micah cet kelune. Pa nreu cailidi nah pa pe ki ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="JDG 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 18:27" />Cu penui Micah ne teikegaide keulu, nah pe gu cingkupei, nah penui Laish ga gwanglu, mina kebwak mene lunghkebam nah kwak eh kebamme kakga. Penui kingtie mui le penuide gidi nah penui namdi de mile rudi. <verse eid="JDG 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 18:28" />Cika kelikelube gede bam ma cide Sidon gade mdei kedine, nah penui migede de ngngwa ncüt kera gahdi. Cide langkam Beth Rehob nam taiga bam. Penui namdi de tei dailu delwe penui cika lunghdi. <verse eid="JDG 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 18:29" />Penui namdi zi Dan qulu, penui pau Dan zi kerüt gade, pa Israel dade lungh gwang kelube. Dede raitu dau namdi zi au Laish. <verse eid="JDG 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 18:30" />Dan namedung penui ziemne mamie heri kelude pwacuhlu. Jonathan, Gershom napei, Manasseh napei, pa nah penamedung penui deu tuipwa di kemakta Dan leuhme ziemne cingkupei tei eh gwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 15:29">2 Heg. 15:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="JDG 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 18:31" />Cine penui ziemne Micah ne teikelu pegu herikelu mamie de pwacuhlu, Tinggwang de kerecaki paiki de Shiloh nam ga kebamtane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 12:1-32">Hez. 12:1-32</ref></char></note><verse eid="JDG 18:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="JDG 19" />
  <para style="s">Levime ge nah pe nauseupui</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 19:1" />Cipau tingdau, Israel deudi reu hegwang ge de kegah dau, cika Levime pei ge hangdeutu deudi Ephraim mdeitu ga lunghla. Pa pe ziemne Judah ga Bethlehem gade kegwang mipui gede, pe nauseupui tei kera luulu. <verse eid="JDG 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 19:2" />Ciuliede, pe nauseupui pedage kemau tei eh kemmhata teidi nah pa pecu ngngwa kebam gade tetpwa Judah ga Bethlehem ga miedi. Pa cika tingkak ge ladi, kei mdai ge. <verse eid="JDG 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 19:3" />Pecai pe nahpei cuhlu delwe pecu suimie, pecu pezaiyi eh mpau gai kera nah pecu ngngwa cailigwang dailu kerane. Pe rehangpei ge pecu ngngwala, nah gadadung gede si eh. Pa pecu pe pei ki ga ngngwa nlüt lu, nah mipuide pei pecu ngau luge, pa pecu redau kelune pesuiyi di. <verse eid="JDG 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 19:4" />Pe nau pei, mipuide pei, pecu bam lulo di cine pa lang cumne peda bamdi. Penui matyei masak, nah penui cika cipau ziu de bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 19:5" />Pecai lang mdaine benai penui tingcang nuge cuhlu, delwe pa tetdi kera cuhlu, ciuliede releipui pei pe napui nahpei dage rangdi, “Tangku kwak ge tyeilu ciude nang ngkieng eh mbeuhlu kerane, ciciulu caine nang tet luzie.” <verse eid="JDG 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 19:6" />Cine penai ntum lwe ngngwa matyei nah sak. Pecai mipuide pei pedade rangdi, “Kehereide neunga eh tingmui ziu bam lulo iciu eh peu n mlung renga gai lu reilo.” <verse eid="JDG 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 19:7" />Pecai minabe tet kera cuhlu, ciuliede pe nau pei pecu bamlu lodi. Cine pa bamdi nah cipau ziude cika bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 19:8" />Pa tingcang nuge cuhlu lang mengei benai tetgai kerane, dede mipuide peibe rangdi, “Kehereide matyei lu rei ciu eh ngkieng eh mbeuhlu kerane.” Cine penai tet kera tingna kecang kwabamdi, delwe penai matyeilu. <verse eid="JDG 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 19:9" />Minabe tet kera cuh luge, pa nah pe nauseupui nah pe rehangpei, pe nau pei, mipui pei pe dage rangdi, “Pielo, kehereide, henai tinghegi dida. Kehereide heziu bamlu rei lo. Pielo, tingbazie cangdi lauda. Aika tingmuiziu bam lulo, ciu eh n mlung tei renga lu rei lo. Pecai ncünne n beuh ziemne nang tingcang nuge cuhlu delwe n kilung ga mie lulo.”<verse eid="JDG 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 19:10" />Dede minabe cipau ziu bamsi neuta di. Cine pa cuhlu delwe pa tetdi. Pa cuikui cide mcwa kebam kemdei Jebus ga gwanglu, cide Jerusalem ga. Pecu ngngwa kelamedung au paklu kebui gada maage la. Nah pe nauseupui de pecu ngngwala. <verse eid="JDG 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 19:11" />Penui Jebus nna di, nah tingna kebaa de mnei sütdi. Cine rehangbe pe mpaube dage rangdi, “Gwanglu, kehereide, anui Jebusitme namdi aide ga nreu nlüt eh cika tingmuiziu bam maisiada.” <verse eid="JDG 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 19:12" />Ciuliede pe mpaupei pe dage rangdi, “Anui sangme namdi ge ga nreu nlüt lak, cika Israel name migede gah. Menane anui Gibeah nam ga canglu kemaktane kah gwangzie.” <verse eid="JDG 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 19:13" />Pecai pa pe rehangpei dage ranggai, “Gwanglu, anui heni aidung ket be ga nna gwanglu go, nah anui Gibeah mecai Ramah nam ga heziu bam dizie.” <verse eid="JDG 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 19:14" />Cine penui tetkah eh jüja gwangdi. Dede penui Benjamin leuhme deu Gibeah cuikui ga gwang nna luge tingnaimiak nlütdi. <verse eid="JDG 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 19:15" />Iciu eh penui cikade nreu pwa Gibeah deukui cipau ziude zeudi kera gwanglu. Penui gwanglu delwe namdi sum renei ga ntumlu, dede migede pezeuziu bam kera penuide luulu ma.<verse eid="JDG 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 19:16" />Cu, ainie, kecing pei ge peta gade gwangla, tinghegi luh gade. Cipaude de hangdeutu Ephraim gade gwang, pa au Gibeah deukui ga lunghla. Dede cipau deu ga kelunghmedung au Benjamin leuhmedung. <verse eid="JDG 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 19:17" />Pa ngang cuh piegai nah pa namdi sumrenei ga mina hebeutei kelame gede ngaulu. Kecing pei de rangdi, “Daiga nang mie launo nah daiga de gwang lano?” <verse eid="JDG 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 19:18" />Pa pe dade, “Anui au Judah ga Bethlehem gade kemdei lambie hangdeutu Ephraim ga kah gwang lalie. Ih cika bamla. Ih Judah ga Bethlehem ga mielie, nah Ih au RAMPAUBE ki ga mie lalie. Dede migede acu hegia beu meda. <verse eid="JDG 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 19:19" />Cipaureude, anui gadadung ziemne reigau de la. A ziemne nah n kilabepui ziemne de tangku nah zau de bam, nah rehangpei ngngwa kela n kilabedung ziemne de. Magede kegah gahlie.” <verse eid="JDG 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 19:20" />Kecing pei rangdi, “Nnui da lungciep lalu! Nnui teu maikesia leune Ih nnui mapie beu zie. Dede nang tingmui sumrenei ga bam kerabe ma.” <verse eid="JDG 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 19:21" />Cine pa pecu pe kilung ga ngngwa gwanglu delwe pa gadadung ziemne taktyei dung rui gaibeu. Penui pi huilwe penui matyei nah saklu.<verse eid="JDG 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 19:22" />Penui renga eh bam ge, ainie, namdi ga minadung kangge, kenlien peime napeidung, penui ki cide twagwalu eh kikam ketung daidai eh bamdi. Penui kecing pei, ki mpaupei dade rangdi, “N ki ga gwang kebamme de lungmpet lo, anui pecu ngngwa nauhepei ta teilu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 19:23" />Minabe, ki mpaube, hegwale penui da pet eh penui dade rangdi, “Lak, a sinamedung, kehereide nnui kemauta tei siabi! Mina aipau de a ki ga lüt kebam ngau eh, nnui hengam aide tei kerabe ma! <verse eid="JDG 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 19:24" />Aika leitin a napui nah pe nauseupui bamlie. Kehereide acu peu penaide ngngwapet beulo iciude nnui penaide tei msia lubui nah penai dage nnui dwade keyibe tei lubui. Dede mina aipaude dage au ma kesia tei gai helo!” <verse eid="JDG 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 19:25" />Dede minadung pekwa kingnei neu tadi, cine minabe pe nauseupui de keraklwe pecu peu hegwale kebamme da petdi. Penui pecu cibam nah penui pecu kemmha ta tei di nah tingcang kemakta tingmuiziu pelane teu heta kesia tei. Pecai penui pecu tingcang baapet ge lang gidi. <verse eid="JDG 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 19:26" />Mipuide tingcang baapet ge gwanglu nah pa mipei cide kimuiki ga pempaube kebam ga kauzeu bamdi, ting baapet kemaktane.<verse eid="JDG 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 19:27" />Pe mpaupei tingcang cuhlu delwe kikam ngkei lu delwe pe lampui le mie kera tetpet di. Dede ainie, mipuibe, pe nauseupui kimuiki ga kau zeu bam nah peba kena au kikampi reu ga bam. <verse eid="JDG 19:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 19:28" />Pa pe dage rangdi, “Cuhlu tet cugo!” Dede samli gahdi, cine pa pecu gada reu gage kailu. Cinzwa eh minabe cuhlwe pe ki ga gwangdi. <verse eid="JDG 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 19:29" />Pa pe ki ga gwanglu ge, pa kieceu nage keulu, nah pa pe nauseupui de keraklu, delwe pa pecu pe radung dang kecaidi, dang kereiekena teilu, delwe pa Israel deu pelane gage langgai. <verse eid="JDG 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 19:30" />Cu cide teizie, cide kengauleune rangdi, “Madaude Israel namedung Egypt gade gwang kelu henai kecang ainzwa tei ma nah ngau ma. Nnuikatei cide cet gai pielo! Heta riemlu delwe rang gailo!”<verse eid="JDG 19:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="JDG 20" />
  <para style="s">Israelme Benjamin leuhme de keregi kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 20:1" />Pecai Israel namedung pelane, nah hemaabe mina hangge nzwa ngkwalu, Dan gade nah Beersheba dei ge nah Gilead deu gade, Mizpah ga RAMPAUBE dwaga gwang ngkwalu. <verse eid="JDG 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 20:2" />Mina pelane muiteumedung, Israel leuhme pelane penui kesang Tinggwang minadung kakga ngkwalu, 400,000 hepi reugwame kingtie ramcau pwa eh. <verse eid="JDG 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 20:3" />Benjamin namedung Mizpah ga Israel namedung hang kedi ha siulu. Ge Israel namedung rangdi, “Dainzwa kemau ta aide gwang di bi rang mci gailo.” <verse eid="JDG 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 20:4" />Cine Levime pei, daptset kedi pui nahpei de, sam keligai. Pa rangdi, “Ih gwang, Ih nah a nauseupui anai, Benjamin gu kideu Gibeah cuikui ga, pezeuziu zeu kerane. <verse eid="JDG 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 20:5" />Gibeah cuikui ramme acu mmau eh renia cuh. Penui a ziemene tingmui ki cide twagwalu. Penui acu teitsetdi kera cet. Meliene penui a nauseupui de teidi cine pa tsaidi. <verse eid="JDG 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 20:6" />Ih a nauseupui paau de kilung pwa gwanglu delwe dang kecailu. Pecai Ih Israel hangdeu gumkelu leune gage kang ge ge langgai beu, kedanemene penui kemau kedi ge tei kedine nah Israel ga hengam tei kegaine. <verse eid="JDG 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 20:7" />Ainie, nnui Israel namedung pelane, nnuikatei cetlu nah riem lulo.”<verse eid="JDG 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 20:8" />Mina pelane cuhlu ket tei eh, ranggai, “Anui migede pe paiki ga cailigwang lak, nah anui migede pe kilung ga caili gwanglak! <verse eid="JDG 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 20:9" />Meliene anui cu Gibeah cuikui dage ainzwa tei gai zie: anui dacak tei zie caube maa ne penui de gwaketang zie bi kecu. <verse eid="JDG 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 20:10" />Israel leuh ge ge gade mina zi kerei gade zi ge de kedet zie, reugwame ketyeipuk peu teugwang kerane, penui Benjamin deu Gibeah ga kemie dau, Israel ga heta siasüt kecu tei kegaine penui de saja peu kerane.” <verse eid="JDG 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 20:11" />Cine Israel mipei leune ngkwalu namdi de mmau eh, mi hangge nzwa eh, maa ge teilu.<verse eid="JDG 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 20:12" />Israel leuhme Benjamin leuhme pelane dage minadung langgai, rang eh, “Nnui kakga tei kegai kemau aide daipai no? <verse eid="JDG 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 20:13" />Ciziemne, cu, mipeidung de peu mpet gailo, kemta namedung de, Gibeah cuikui ga kebammedung, ciude anui penuide teitset dizie, nah iciu eh anui Israel gade kemau keugi di kerane.” Dede penui au neulu ma, Benjamin, penui sinamedung kwa de kingnei kera, Israel namedung. <verse eid="JDG 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 20:14" />Pecai Benjamin namedung penuikatei Gibeah cuikui namdidung gwale gwang ngkwalu, Israel namedung de keregi kera tetpet. <verse eid="JDG 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 20:15" />Benjamin namedung cipaunai namdidung gade kingtie kepwame mina cang ngkaieherok kelunglu eh hekwalu. Aide gwale de, Gibeah cuikui ga kelungme kakgade mina hai hena de kelanglwe kelunglu. <verse eid="JDG 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 20:16" />Aidung pelane kakgade mina hai hena kedet kelume bam, zetle ba kesiame, cipaumedung pelane tangtsukang teu eh tamlei gede kap dau lubui nah kapzeu di lama.<verse eid="JDG 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 20:17" />Israelme peidung, Benjamin caide, penui ziemne hekwalu mipei kingtie kepwa 400,000, aidung pelane reugwa keyime. <verse eid="JDG 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 20:18" />Pecai penui cuhlu nah Bethel ga hang. Israel namedung Tinggwang de keteu nah penui rangdi, “Caune hang lai anui ziemne keraibe tei eh Benjamin namedung de ngngwa hereu ketei ga?” RAMPAUBE ranggai, “Judah ne keraibe teizie.”<verse eid="JDG 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 20:19" />Cine Israelme tingcang cuhlu nah penui Gibeah cuikui kenna ga ramzeuki teilu. <verse eid="JDG 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 20:20" />Israelme peidung Benjamin de regi kera tetmie. Israelme peidung Gibeah ga kebamdung de regi kera mteilu. <verse eid="JDG 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 20:21" />Dede Benjamin namedung Gibeah cuikui de tetpet di, nah cipaunai penui Israel gade mina cang ngkaiekena de hangdeu gage teitsetdi. <verse eid="JDG 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 20:22" />Ciuliede minadung, Israel mepeidung penuide tei ngkuulu delwe penui kerai benai mtei kelu ni gage regi kera mtei dailu. <verse eid="JDG 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 20:23" />Pecai Israel namedung mielu nah penui RAMPAUBE dwade hapdi tinghegidi kemaktane. Penui RAMPAUBE dade keteu eh, ranggai, “Ih gwaketang si eh reuni, A sinabe Benjamin name de ngngwa regi eh?” RAMPAUBE sam keligai, “Mie pecu ketang cu!”<verse eid="JDG 20:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 20:24" />Cine lang pekenabe benai Israel namedung Benjamin namedung de nna gwanglu. <verse eid="JDG 20:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 20:25" />Benjamin penuide renia kerane lang pekena benai Gibeah cuikui gade tetpet lu, nah Israelme de mcwa eh penui hangdeu gage mina keda cang kerei heset de teitsetdi. Aidung pelane de kingtie kepwame. <verse eid="JDG 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JDG 20:26" />Pecai Israel namedung nah mina pelane hanglu nah penui Bethel ga gwangdi. Penui hapdi, nah penui cika RAMPAUBE dwaga ntumlu. Penui cipaunai tinghegi kecang mmwang, pecai penui keru recadung nah kezuyi recadung RAMPAUBE dwage teigai. <verse eid="JDG 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JDG 20:27" />Israel namedung RAMPAUBE de keteudi, kedanemene cidau Tinggwang samkakbung cika kebamne, <verse eid="JDG 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="JDG 20:28" />Phinehas, Eleazar napei, Aaron napei cipau tingdau cide dwaga hegwatei bam kecu dau, ranggai, “Ih Benjamin, a sinabe namedung de renia eh piage hereu ga tetpet maisia reuni mi Ih mtak di lai?” RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Nghang cu, Ih ncünne pecu pwa n ba gage kai beu zie.”<verse eid="JDG 20:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="JDG 20:29" />Cine Israelme hemaa teilwe Gibeah cuikui lule ailambie kwa twagwalu kum kera. <verse eid="JDG 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="JDG 20:30" />Israelme Benjamin namedung de lang cumne benai gwahang, nah penui ndaa nzwa Gibeah cuikui de ngngwa regi kera mteilu. <verse eid="JDG 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="JDG 20:31" />Benjamin namedung minadung de renia kerane tetpet lu. Penuide namdi gade kemeu mdei di, nah penui midungge de kedeu miedi. Israel mipei camrei kenzwa ge de teitsetdi ndaa lampui gade tei kedi nzwa, cide ket Bethel ga hangdi nah kedabe luh kakgade Gibeah cuikui ga mie. <verse eid="JDG 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="JDG 20:32" />Pecai Benjamin namedung rangdi, “Anui dwade penuide ngam luda, keraibe pia nzwa.” Dede Israel namedung rangdi, “Anui pak gaigo iciude anui penuide namdi gade lampuiki gage gwagai luzie.” <verse eid="JDG 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="JDG 20:33" />Pecai Israelme leune pe bam gade cuhlwe Baal Tamar nam ga hereu bamdung teilu. Israel ga swalwe mbai kebamdung pebam Maareh Gibeah gade pak mpetlu. <verse eid="JDG 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="JDG 20:34" />Israel pelane gade kedetkelu mina cang kerei de Gibeah cuikui kengau ga mpetlu, nah hereu cide teisütdi. Dede penui au kengkap aide penui da nna bamlie kecu cima. <verse eid="JDG 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="JDG 20:35" />Cinzwa eh RAMPAUBE Israel dwagade Benjamin de ngamdi. Cipau nai Israel namedung ne Benjamin de ngkapdi, mipei 25,100, cidung pelane de kingtie kepwame.<verse eid="JDG 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="JDG 20:36" />Cine Benjamin namedung penuide ngam kedi ngaulu. Israel ga minadung Benjamin de heni ge peu, kedanemene penui au mina Gibeah cuikui gage peu mbai eh kwa kebam maade mninghemi kedine. <verse eid="JDG 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="JDG 20:37" />Pecai mbai eh kwa kebam maade kelwa eh nah lwapet Gibeah cuikui de twagwalu. Mbai kwa kebam maade pakpet kingtie pwa namdi de pelane bikau di. <verse eid="JDG 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="JDG 20:38" />Cidau Israelme peidung mbai eh kwa kebam maade ziemne nrai heciem riem pwabam: mimang teilu iciude penui mi teingkaa kegaide namdi gade kaapet lu kerane, <verse eid="JDG 20:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="JDG 20:39" />Israel mepeidung hereu gade caili kecudau. Pecai Benjamin gwaketang cuhdi, Israelme mina camrei gede daptsetdi. Penui rangdi, “Pecu au anui dwaga ngam kesang tei dida, hereu keraibe gade nzwa.” <verse eid="JDG 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="JDG 20:40" />Dede cidau marehi de namdi gade mikaa tsia ge ngaupet cuh di, Ge Benjamin cika nreu caili di. Kesangbe, ainie, namdi cide pelane gade mikaa ting ga hangdi. <verse eid="JDG 20:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="JDG 20:41" />Pecai Israel mepeidung caili di. Benjamin leuhme pelane penui ngngidi, penui kekap penui reuga kegwang ngau kelune. <verse eid="JDG 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="JDG 20:42" />Cine penui Israelme peidung dwa gade hetaideu ge pak caili gai, dede keregi kecu de pedwa raigwangdi. Cidau namdidung gade mpet kelamedung pe kak gade pecu ngkapbam di. <verse eid="JDG 20:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="JDG 20:43" />Penui Benjamin de twagwalu, penui pecu teimpak gai. Reluicui eh penuide Gibeah cuikui kemcwa kecang ga tei ngkap ciak dedi, tingnaimiak kepet lambie tu ga. <verse eid="JDG 20:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="JDG 20:44" />Penui Benjamin dade kaudi, mipeime cang kerei heset, aidung pelane kekuume. <verse eid="JDG 20:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="JDG 20:45" />Pecai penui nreulwe hetaideu gage pakgai eh Rimmon tsura ga gwanglu. Penui puiceunadung gade mina cang mengei de teitsetdi. Penui Gidom nam ga kecang gwazui nna süt eh gwang, nah penui pedade mina cang na de teitset di. <verse eid="JDG 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="JDG 20:46" />Cine cipaunai Benjamin name pelane tsaikedime kingtie kepwame mipei cang ngkai mengei. Aidung pelane mina kekuume. <verse eid="JDG 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="JDG 20:47" />Dede mina hai herok caililu nah penui hetaideu gage pak gailu, Rimmon tsura lambie. Penui Rimmon tsura ga kei mdai bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 20:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="JDG 20:48" />Pecai Israel namedung Benjamin namedung da cailigwang. Penui penuide kingtie mui le teitsetdi, namdi ge de pelane, makaune de si nah ngau kelu keheileu de. Penui ngau kelu namdidung leune de, penui rudi.<verse eid="JDG 20:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="JDG 21" />
  <para style="s">Israel Benjamin leuhme ziemne henau peu kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JDG 21:1" />Israelme mipei mige ge kecu Mizpah gade rang eh reset sam aide le penuide kanglu, “Anui migede anui napui de peu eh Benjamin leuhme depeu pe nau lak.” <verse eid="JDG 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JDG 21:2" />Pecai, minadung Bethel ga gwanglu nah cika penui Tinggwang dwaga tinghegi kecang bamdi. Penui penui kwa hu eh penui hapdi, sahbak eh hap bamdi. <verse eid="JDG 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JDG 21:3" />Penui hapdi, “O RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, daitei aide Israel dage teigai dino, henai Israel gade heleuh ket gah sidi kera?” <verse eid="JDG 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JDG 21:4" />Cu ciciu eh pecai benai minadung cuh zilu nah penui cika recabam ge teilu delwe penui keru reca nah kezuyi recadung teigai. <verse eid="JDG 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JDG 21:5" />Israel namedung rangdi, “Israel leuhdung kakgade hemaabe de ngngwa eh RAMPAUBE da nghang kemak caube no?” Kedanemene reset kedide cai renia Mizpah ga RAMPAUBE da hang kemakme ziemne rangpwa bam, “Pecu teitsetdi bi maisia.” <verse eid="JDG 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JDG 21:6" />Israel namedung au penui sinabe Benjamin de ngaunggiadi. Penui rangdi, “Henai Israel gade heleuh gede keu gi dida. <verse eid="JDG 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JDG 21:7" />Anui penui ziemne daipai teilu buino, bangpwa kebamme ziemne, henau ge ziemne, anui anuikatei pwa RAMPAUBE dage peu anui napuidung penui nau laklie reset di delu?”<verse eid="JDG 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JDG 21:8" />Penui rangdi, “Israel leuh gade caube Mizpah namdi ga RAMPAUBE da nghang kemak bamno?” Cu ainie, hemaabe ga, ramzeuki ga nghang kemakme au Jabesh Gilead nam gade da. <verse eid="JDG 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JDG 21:9" />Minadung penuide pei kegai dau, ainie, Jabesh Gilead nam ga kelunghme migede cika bam ma. <verse eid="JDG 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JDG 21:10" />Cine hemaabe mina cang kerei kena cikage langgai, reugwame napeidungde gade, nah penui sam rang eh penuide ledeu gai, Miecu, delwe nnui kingtie pwa Jabesh Gilead nam ga kelunghme de bitset di maisia, mipuidung nah henamedung de de. <verse eid="JDG 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JDG 21:11" />“Aidungde nnui teilu maisia: mipei nah mipui leune tin kemakme de teitset dilu.” <verse eid="JDG 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JDG 21:12" />Penui Jabesh Gilead nam ga kelunghme kakga mipui hename hai mdai bam eh ngaulu, leitinme, mipei de ngkop di ci kemakme, nah penui penuide Canaan deuga kebam Shiloh ramzeuki ga ngngwa gwanglu.<verse eid="JDG 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JDG 21:13" />Hemaabe pelane tetpetlu delwe penui Rimmon tsura ga kebam Benjamin namedung de marang, nah penui dage ngngwa kezuyi sahgai. <verse eid="JDG 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JDG 21:14" />Cidau Benjamin caili gwanglu nah penui Jabesh Gilead ga mipui ring kebam puidung gade pwa penuide peudi. Dede penui penui ziemne ngaucang luma. <verse eid="JDG 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JDG 21:15" />Minadung Benjamin ziemne penui lung siadi, kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israel leuhmedung kakgage ngngwa kesiage tei kebeune.<verse eid="JDG 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JDG 21:16" />Pecai hemaabe hangkiamedung rangdi, “Dainzwa eh anui bangkelumedung ziemne penui naudung peeilu laino, Benjamin leuh gade mipuidung de teitset kapdi delu?” <verse eid="JDG 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JDG 21:17" />Penui rangdi, “Benjamin leuh gade bangkelume ziemne pe leuh ge cika bam maisia, iciu eh Israel gade heleuh gede tei nggah di melu kerane. <verse eid="JDG 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JDG 21:18" />Dede anui au anui napuidung kakgade nau penuide peu gailak da, kedanemene Israel namedung de au samkak gele kangpwa bamdi delu, ‘Benjamin de henau ge kepeube depeu reset punglu.’” De kecude. <verse eid="JDG 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JDG 21:19" />Cine penui rangdi, “Ainie, mmi ramsangne ngyi Shiloh namdi ga RAMPAUBE ziemne hengyi bamla, cide Bethel namdi tingpeule bam, Bethel namdi gade Shechem namdi ga kegwang lampui naimiak kepetle lebie ga, nah Lebonah tingbangle bie.” <verse eid="JDG 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JDG 21:20" />Penui Benjamin namedung de maranglia eh ranggai, “Mie delwe kubeluh ga mbai eh kwalu. <verse eid="JDG 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JDG 21:21" />Nnui pielu nah ainie, Shiloh napuidung helim lim kera kepet dau, cidau nnui kubeluh gade mpetlu. Nnui nnui ziemne Shiloh napuidung ket ket tui luzie penau kerane, nah pecai nnui Benjamin deu ga cailigwang lubui. <verse eid="JDG 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JDG 21:22" />Penui peime mede penui heimedung anuide ngngwa rang repia kera kegwang dau, anui penui dage rangzie, ‘Penuide mta pwa anuide peulo, kedanemene anui hereu aide tingdau migede penui nau luulu melu. Cidau nnui penuide peu kemakme, nnui mau di lubui.’” <verse eid="JDG 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JDG 21:23" />Benjamin namedung cinzwa teilu. Penui lim kebamdau penui naudung mnunglu kera pung tetdi, penuide kerak teu tetdi. Pecai penui caili penui mabam ga penui miedi. Penui namdidung teilu delwe penui cika lunghdi. <verse eid="JDG 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JDG 21:24" />Pecai Israelme cikade cidau penuikatei tet lamnadi, ket ket kecu penui leuh nah penui kelakdung ga gwangdi. Iciu eh cikade penui mabam rip ga penui miedi.<verse eid="JDG 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JDG 21:25" />Cipau tingdau Israel ga hegwang gede bam ma. Ket ket kecu pe dwade kenzeube tei gwang.<verse eid="JDG 21:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JDG 21" />
</usx>